: "default", "desc": "Bug 2068929 - Add sync section to AccountSettings screen. r=android-reviewers,android-l10n-reviewers,flod,cbect\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326532\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/layout/preference_category_padding_top_no_icon_style.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values/dimens.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/xml/account_settings_preferences.xml"], "git_node": "0fc517960adab0aaabd49d28248702c4a9182152", "git_parents": ["a52664afdf8aded041cf1856f8cb95caca18dcf3"], "node": "01ce4060bceb4fb1f28aa0c5d579fd39e817881d", "parents": ["d0044a3cbb0f371de3c487de921d0c6be25f81d6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Titouan Thibaud \u003ctthibaud@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068929 - Update Account and Sync Preferences titles on the Preferences and AccountSettings screens. r=android-reviewers,android-l10n-reviewers,cbect,parker\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326533\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/settings/SettingsFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/settings/account/AccountSettingsFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml"], "git_node": "41156ff079c9b184cd311557c5eebc7031491905", "git_parents": ["0fc517960adab0aaabd49d28248702c4a9182152"], "node": "913409af99c57e1660dbbfc81010201b5dd2ca82", "parents": ["01ce4060bceb4fb1f28aa0c5d579fd39e817881d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew Osmond \u003caosmond@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074694 - Fix intermittent test failure in dom/media/webaudio/test/test_audioContextGC.html. r=media-playback-reviewers,alwu\n\nDepending on the event order, we may have reached the \"suspended\"\nstate when the onended callback fires. We should instead just\nverify the \"running\" state change from the onstatechange callback.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328662\n", "files": ["dom/media/webaudio/test/test_audioContextGC.html"], "git_node": "02f5281638ad4f9882bc1e757f0f288b21714361", "git_parents": ["41156ff079c9b184cd311557c5eebc7031491905"], "node": "c5629129dd83074616f6b0725800a38ff80d31d1", "parents": ["913409af99c57e1660dbbfc81010201b5dd2ca82"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Taimur Hasan \u003cthasan@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073254 - Add Page Extractor developer documentation r=ai-platform-reviewers,nordzilla\n\nDocument how extraction fits together, how to extract from a tab or a hidden browser, privacy considerations, observability, and contributor guidance. Point at PageExtractor.d.ts for options and results instead of duplicating them. Register the documentation tree and link it from the Firefox AI Runtime docs.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327146\n", "files": ["docs/config.yml", "toolkit/components/ml/docs/index.md", "toolkit/components/pageextractor/docs/contributing.md", "toolkit/components/pageextractor/docs/index.md", "toolkit/components/pageextractor/docs/observability.md", "toolkit/components/pageextractor/moz.build"], "git_node": "9699aa7ede2dc5fe63cb6f184a0400403b49a76a", "git_parents": ["02f5281638ad4f9882bc1e757f0f288b21714361"], "node": "6fc14a81fa2f54cb1884a2f54f59556e6aea2c2a", "parents": ["c5629129dd83074616f6b0725800a38ff80d31d1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Maxx Crawford \u003cmcrawford@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066236 - Gate widget availability by market r=reemhamz\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325667\n", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "browser/extensions/newtab/lib/ActivityStream.sys.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/lib/PrefsFeed.sys.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/lib/ActivityStream.test.js", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/lib/PrefsFeed.test.js"], "g