from f72faef7f3\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/f72faef7f38bd3a1215f0dad407ab2aac2fe4b98\n    Add SwitchingFrameReader test utility.\n\n    The util allows opening multi frame readers, and then switches the feed\n    between them with a configurale interval. This is useful for simulating\n    inputs where there are multiple cameras the can be changed in realtime.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:496266459\n    Change-Id: I2d93225254f8c4ebf0123e12faf94c62a5bba0f6\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/499800\n    Reviewed-by: Sergey Silkin \u003cssilkin@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Per Kjellander \u003cperkj@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Erik Spr\u00e5ng \u003csprang@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Erik Spr\u00e5ng \u003csprang@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48505}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/test/video_quality_test_fixture.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0091.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0094.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/testsupport/switching_frame_reader.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/testsupport/switching_frame_reader.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/testsupport/switching_frame_reader_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/video_loopback.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/video_quality_test.cc"], "git_node": "76cad05c4b6efcbc51d626a314d009214bfc15f8", "git_parents": ["f714ed06349749de7560d6ed3a0c84eb92f855cf"], "node": "12fd6dfee6fa723718442a19747baebc18859974", "parents": ["a344427548e68d66b2ed22444c8c555d38ac375d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dan Baker \u003cdbaker@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072400 - Vendor libwebrtc from 29be127b7a\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/29be127b7ad788c0934c145858983c9941b061b3\n    Add audio_level, absolute_capture_timestamp and csrcs overrides to audio injection path.\n\n    Bug: chromium:532190488\n    Change-Id: I024420c716cb411518f0b9ab3373d46a1874668f\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/498801\n    Reviewed-by: Jakob Ivarsson\u200e \u003cjakobi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Henrik Bostr\u00f6m \u003chbos@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Guido Urdaneta \u003cguidou@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48506}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/audio_codecs/audio_encoder.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/audio/channel_send.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_coding/acm2/audio_coding_module.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_coding/acm2/audio_coding_module_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_coding/include/audio_coding_module.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0029.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0069.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/encoded_audio_frame_injector.cc"], "git_node": "1333a8cb44ffec0bf83c029e1e28157e23de0420", "git_parents": ["76cad05c4b6efcbc51d626a314d009214bfc15f8"], "node": "df4c5ed01e6eb190e26c5f4ca64808e41fba4892", "parents": ["12fd6dfee6fa723718442a19747baebc18859974"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dan Baker \u003cdbaker@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072400 - Vendor libwebrtc from 22848987f8\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/22848987f89f01a20c3086b272521f8f8fa9b3d7\n    pc: trace create, addTrack and addTransceiver\n\n    Bug: webrtc:532923549\n    Change-Id: I9414bf43683a66a49b1e53acbe5c041a78e16220\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/499041\n    Reviewed-by: Henrik Bostr\u00f6m \u003chbos@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Philipp Hancke \u003cphilipp.hancke@googlemail.com\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Guido Urdaneta \u003cguidou@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48507}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/peer_connection_tracer_interface.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0094.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_tracer_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "e53cdc4b02196565251dbaf7c34469187ca041f9", "git_parents": ["1333a8cb44ffec0bf83c029e1e28157e23de0420"], "node": "baf2b629064bd3583a226848d2095b15dd4964fb", "parents": ["df4c5ed01e6eb190e26c5f4ca64808e41fba4892"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dan Baker \u003cdbaker@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072400 - Vendor libwebrtc from e9fc3ee8c6\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/e9fc3ee8c65058e5202683d0068100a8dec2d9c9\n    pc: trace restartIce and addIceCandidate with result/error\n\n    ignoring the \"legacy\" path. Also drop the \"Event\" from the ONN trace\n    method for consistency.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:532923549\n    Change-Id: I042af692a9f41d078cc2eb2d65494f6264e69f4e\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/500040\n    Reviewed-by: Henrik Bostr\u00f6m \u003chbos@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Guido Urdaneta \u003cguidou@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Philipp Hancke \u003cphilipp.hancke@googlemail.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48508}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/peer_connection_tracer_interface.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_tracer_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "95607dd368aef98b023fd5535bf5f199cdf16141", "git_parents": ["e53cdc4b02196565251dbaf7c34469187ca041f9"], "node": "ff2d14009f7a0584b89f5b428a78ab6eb521effd", "parents": ["baf2b629064bd3583a226848d2095b15dd4964fb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dan Baker \u003cdbaker@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072400 - Vendor libwebrtc from a722beb9d9\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/a722beb9d9f8e63ff24c6a2319e7aee3c8f52358\n    Add cl-description skill for authoring CL messages\n\n    Add an agent skill providing guidelines, a step-by-step workflow,\n    and formatting rules for writing high-quality Gerrit CL descriptions\n    and Git commit messages adhering to WebRTC and Chromium standards.\n\n    Bug: none\n    No-try: true\n    Change-Id: I897e01e1b370e58060b48923d0f5b93812cdfb05\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/500720\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48509}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/agents/skills/cl-description/SKILL.md"], "git_node": "6d51510b1495e0dc8bfeaf2e3826f61fafb132eb", "git_parents": ["95607dd368aef98b023fd5535bf5f199cdf16141"], "node": "9ba67db40e69d85d7caa4b0579efa907632c5551", "parents": ["ff2d14009f7a0584b89f5b428a78ab6eb521effd"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dan Baker \u003cdbaker@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072400 - Vendor libwebrtc from 21a9800313\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/21a9800313e79c0246dabc4cd9f3def01cabd224\n    pc: use ssrc_s() in stats collectors on signaling thread\n\n    Avoid cross-thread calls to the worker thread to query the SSRC\n    for receivers in RTCStatsCollector and LegacyStatsCollector by\n    using the signaling thread accessor ssrc_s().\n\n    In LegacyStatsCollector, this allows receiver_track_id_by_ssrc\n    to be populated directly on the signaling thread, removing the\n    receiver iteration from the worker thread BlockingCall and\n    simplifying ChannelStatsGatherer.\n\n    Bug: none\n    Change-Id: I6294d52e84b1ef2012aa64ffadb2cc41f055f96b\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/499601\n    Reviewed-by: Henrik Bostr\u00f6m \u003chbos@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48510}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/legacy_stats_collector.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/legacy_stats_collector_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtc_stats_collector.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtc_stats_collector_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "c5e32f46decc84def484705f338b95ebee13a7ff", "git_parents": ["6d51510b1495e0dc8bfeaf2e3826f61fafb132eb"], "node": "2cbe8139276ebcdad1c575c60874b27f82c83687", "parents": ["9ba67db40e69d85d7caa4b0579efa907632c5551"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dan Baker \u003cdbaker@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072400 - Vendor libwebrtc from 61b894dca3\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/61b894dca36bbf1da796e802e5ffb7d172af54e6\n    Delete ConnectionContext::use_rtx\n\n    It is always true in production code\n\n    Bug: webrtc:42225769\n    Change-Id: I4695734db8ed424cc6e3dc2d9e9b9fbef3f4f179\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/500601\n    Reviewed-by: Henrik Bostr\u00f6m \u003chbos@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48511}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0094.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/connection_context.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/connection_context.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_factory.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_factory_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/test/fake_codec_lookup_helper.h"], "git_node": "6d06b964a7653355cd30b43b92713d74a6a2b75e", "git_parents": ["c5e32f46decc84def484705f338b95ebee13a7ff"], "node": "fde49e93ea9ad0ccbb5059829ca305c5ca1503a3", "parents": ["2cbe8139276ebcdad1c575c60874b27f82c83687"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dan Baker \u003cdbaker@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072400 - Vendor libwebrtc from 5e94740d3a\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/5e94740d3a6f2e5fede9a68ad6a1e500793e126c\n    pc: resolve chained AddIceCandidate calls in order\n\n    The chained AddIceCandidate operation declared itself complete before\n    invoking its callback. OperationsChain runs the next operation\n    synchronously from there, so two AddIceCandidate() calls queued behind a\n    pending operation resolved in reverse order.\n\n    Latent since ee6f4f67ef put AddIceCandidate on the operations chain.\n\n    Bug: chromium:40105256\n    Change-Id: I6c72bb1b7844867334e725448ba6f62d0c074cfb\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/500080\n    Reviewed-by: Henrik Bostr\u00f6m \u003chbos@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Guido Urdaneta \u003cguidou@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Philipp Hancke \u003cphilipp.hancke@googlemail.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48512}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_ice_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/sdp_offer_answer.cc"], "git_node": "0751f5adea7383d80d697fe40d415bdef4f5ec9b", "git_parents": ["6d06b964a7653355cd30b43b92713d74a6a2b75e"], "node": "0980ec7be51929301e8ad3c0f6fc9fb4a531cce4", "parents": ["fde49e93ea9ad0ccbb5059829ca305c5ca1503a3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dan Baker \u003cdbaker@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072400 - Vendor libwebrtc from a6fd926d2c\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/a6fd926d2ca7e622c090c56da798f464e5af18e5\n    Roll chromium_revision dca9c4468e..ff37f76274 (1690475:1693276)\n\n    Change log: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+log/dca9c4468e..ff37f76274\n    Full diff: https://chrom