bricator.services.mozilla.com/D328046\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/lib/ActivityStream.sys.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/components/Widgets/WidgetsRegistry.test.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/lib/ActivityStream.test.js", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/lib/PrefsFeed.test.js"], "git_node": "0cbf500520186d01291262fd4f5ab6205cc3eb64", "git_parents": ["176fb01597ffde3e24e4261a9678c81b5a59880a"], "node": "cf581b8d74ecdfbd9ba5ab415b60c191581148d7", "parents": ["9dd6955ab85c217bc87c9281bb766ec021b79923"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Maxx Crawford \u003cmcrawford@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066247 - Turn Stocks widget off by default for all regions r=reemhamz\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328656\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/lib/ActivityStream.sys.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/components/Widgets/WidgetsRegistry.test.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/lib/ActivityStream.test.js", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/lib/PrefsFeed.test.js"], "git_node": "8b80c4a136764a3cdce50e295a559cad6925f10c", "git_parents": ["0cbf500520186d01291262fd4f5ab6205cc3eb64"], "node": "c20e5a7cff379e63c11785ceac5c0a1214bc7b6c", "parents": ["cf581b8d74ecdfbd9ba5ab415b60c191581148d7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Maxx Crawford \u003cmcrawford@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074974 - Turn Recent Searches widget off by default for all regions r=reemhamz\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328657\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/lib/ActivityStream.sys.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/components/Widgets/WidgetsRegistry.test.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/lib/ActivityStream.test.js", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/lib/PrefsFeed.test.js"], "git_node": "afd16432c09ae7ddbe0a2bd3fafa0fab7461cbc6", "git_parents": ["8b80c4a136764a3cdce50e295a559cad6925f10c"], "node": "61917153751414d5362c6e9a5dbfe64c0b435ade", "parents": ["c20e5a7cff379e63c11785ceac5c0a1214bc7b6c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Maxx Crawford \u003cmcrawford@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066245 - Make Crossword available to English locales outside PL, off by default r=reemhamz\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328658\n", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "browser/extensions/newtab/lib/ActivityStream.sys.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/lib/ActivityStream.test.js", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/lib/PrefsFeed.test.js"], "git_node": "fecc41615f94b337b45d1908a409a37a1219a435", "git_parents": ["afd16432c09ae7ddbe0a2bd3fafa0fab7461cbc6"], "node": "35a1e6be6b82daa490854d275e1f74a7c5255813", "parents": ["61917153751414d5362c6e9a5dbfe64c0b435ade"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Maxx Crawford \u003cmcrawford@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075001 - Add a pref to enforce widget market gating on Nightly r=reemhamz\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328659\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/lib/ActivityStream.sys.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/lib/ActivityStream.test.js"], "git_node": "12ad59ecce8c86508b6b8851967e9b51d5ec5350", "git_parents": ["fecc41615f94b337b45d1908a409a37a1219a435"], "node": "764b17a4b11b216dd57537a54c0457cd3a173d36", "parents": ["35a1e6be6b82daa490854d275e1f74a7c5255813"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Maxx Crawford \u003cmcrawford@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075271 - Stub the widget market prefs in newtab for older hosts r=thecount\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328867\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/common/WidgetsRegistry.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/lib/ActivityStream.sys.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/lib/ActivityStream.test.js"], "git_node": "408c0488f50a1b35a56c6561cd2aeaf4695be52d", "git_parents": ["12ad59ecce8c86508b6b8851967e9b51d5ec5350"], "node": "c304702293cd87c3f31bda11c3260a371121701a", "parents": ["764b17a4b11b216dd57537a54c0457cd3a173d36"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Maile Lucks \u003cmlucks@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2071887 - Sync panel-list open state when the popover is light-dismissed by the UA r=reusable-components-reviewers,mstriemer\n\npanel-list opens its popover on mousedown (via moz-button), so no popover is open yet at pointerdown. When a press begins before the popover opens and is released on the page background, the UA light-dismisses the popover on pointerup without panel-list's hide() ever running. The `open` attribute is left set, so the list keeps painting via the `[open]` styles (display: block; position: absolute) once it drops out of the top layer, resolving its viewport-derived left/top against a positioned ancestor and landing in the wrong place (e.g. bottom-right on the Smart Window new tab).\n\nFix: register the popover `toggle` event in addHideListeners()/removeHideListeners() and, in handleEvent, force a hide() when newState is \"closed\" while `open` is still set. This clears the attribute, fires the `hidden` event and resets aria-expanded so a UA dismissal is kept in sync with panel-list's own state. Normal hide() paths remove the toggle listener before their queued toggle event fires, so there is no double-hide.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325924\n", "files": ["toolkit/content/tests/widgets/test_panel_list_popover.html", "toolkit/content/widgets/panel-list/panel-list.mjs"], "git_node": "873d7726c83ceb2386abd9e7ec846c5f63caf1b5", "git_parents": ["408c0488f50a1b35a56c6561cd2aeaf4695be52d"], "node": "6978ac4b671864859416a7e5487211832eba1498", "parents": ["c304702293cd87c3f31bda11c3260a371121701a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Hiroyuki Ikezoe \u003chikezoe.birchill@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2013264 - Expand the fixed viewport and the scroll range while the software keyboard is visible. r=botond,geckoview-reviewers,layout-reviewers,emilio,owlish\n\nThis ensures that when the visual viewport is scrolled to the bottom of\nthe layout viewport and the software keyboard is visible, bottom-fixed\nelements are aligned with the bottom of the visual viewport.\n\n`fixedElementRectOnCollapsedToolbarWithKeyboardOnResizesVisual` is for\nthe change in PresShell::GetFixedViewportSize.\n`fixedElementWithKeyboardOnResizesVisual` is for the change in\nExpandHeightForDynamicToolbarImpl. Though the latter also depends on the\nformer change.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324450\n", "files": ["layout/base/PresShell.cpp", "layout/base/nsLayoutUtils.cpp", "layout/base/nsPresContext.cpp", "layout/base/nsPresContext.h", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/test/InteractiveWidgetTest.kt"], "git_node": "a3466539946b00df1f3c7ce45168a3acce548bc1", "git_parents": ["873d7726c83ceb2386abd9e7ec846c5f63caf1b5"], "node": "7ee35a6f8504793c298f9c3f05fd62175c9e825d", "parents": ["6978ac4b671864859416a7e5487211832eba1498"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Hiroyuki Ikezoe \u003chikezoe.birchill@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2013264 - Move position:fixed content while the dynamic toolbar is in transition with the software keyboard visible. r=botond,geckoview-reviewers,owlish\n\nComputeFixedMarginsOffset refused to compensate for the dynamic toolbar offset\nwhenever the software keyboard was visible outside resizes-content. The main\nthread doesn't reposition position:fixed content until the toolbar is fully\ncollapsed, so while the toolbar is in transition the compositor is the only\nthing that can move it, and suppressing that leaves a blank strip the size of\nthe part of the toolbar that has already gone away.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324451\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/apz/src/APZCTreeManager.cpp", "gfx/layers/apz/src/APZCTreeManager.h", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/test/InteractiveWidgetTest.kt"], "git_node": "ba587a432f02905f40b656b18edd06496e789ca0", "git_parents": ["a3466539946b00df1f3c7ce45168a3acce548bc1"], "node": "9ea47e333d93a3280d8de72fea94c3aba55e7806", "parents": ["7ee35a6f8504793c298f9c3f05fd62175c9e825d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2013264 - Move position:fixed content while the dynamic toolbar is in transition with the software keyboard visible. r=botond,geckoview-reviewers,owlish\" for causing Linting failure.\n\nThis reverts commit ba587a432f02905f40b656b18edd06496e789ca0.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2013264 - Expand the fixed viewport and the scroll range while the software keyboard is visible. r=botond,geckoview-reviewers,layout-reviewers,emilio,owlish\"\n\nThis reverts commit a3466539946b00df1f3c7ce45168a3acce548bc1.\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/apz/src/APZCTreeManager.cpp", "gfx/layers/apz/src/APZCTreeManager.h", "layout/base/PresShell.cpp", "layout/base/nsLayoutUtils.cpp", "layout/base/nsPresContext.cpp", "layout/base/nsPresContext.h", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/test/InteractiveWidgetTest.kt"], "git_node": "220184b1d21078dfb722a9b7e25c1962ade6e717", "git_parents": ["ba587a432f02905f40b656b18edd06496e789ca0"], "node": "09903f2d0576adb7d70877bb9372eb9af66359b3", "parents": ["9ea47e333d93a3280d8de72fea94c3aba55e7806"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lando \u003clando@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Merge Mozilla-central to autoland\n", "files": [], "git_node": "12f5c115679752acfadb018204f26c19e573a976", "git_parents": ["220184b1d21078dfb722a9b7e25c1962ade6e717", "0a5c5bffebd796cedba281419efd2f8f3cc7c85d"], "node": "999270bc4e311a1f7f51b394497015046b39bfac", "parents": ["09903f2d0576adb7d70877bb9372eb9af66359b3", "2540d2ffbff0a35d8aa712e9b434c5413dbb8023"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Silaghi \u003casilaghi@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2074282 - Load saved wallpapers directly from the wallpaper library. r=mconley\" for causing mochitest failures at wallpaper directory\n\nThis reverts commit 9fa8525e8c3c4c3250a079c8de2eb8c879aa82fa.\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/common/Actions.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/common/Reducers.sys.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/WallpaperCategories/WallpaperCategories.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/WallpaperCategories/_WallpaperCategories.scss", "browser/extensions/newtab/lib/Wallpapers/WallpaperFeed.sys.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/lib/Wallpapers/WallpaperFileNames.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/lib/Wallpapers/WallpaperThemeUtils.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/components/WallpaperCategories/WallpaperCategories.test.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/lib/Wallpapers/WallpaperThemeUtils.test.js", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/xpcshell/test_WallpaperFeed.js"], "git_node": "5b0fe7ab55cec9c69342b72439d04ec359b96de1", "git_parents": ["12f5c115679752acfadb018204f26c19e573a976"], "node": "e8c16426ab1a58e88bb4b26e1fcdebf91cde9c02", "parents": ["999270bc4e311a1f7f51b394497015046b39bfac"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Silaghi \u003casilaghi@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2009747 - Patch 4 - Open the macOS share picker directly from the share toolbar button. r=mac-reviewers,bradwerth\" for causing browser chrome mochitests failures at skin/qrcode.svg\n\nThis reverts commit d0e1bdea6b70bc052a48952ca0684d049ac51109.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2009747 - Patch 3 - Replace the address bar context menu Share submenu with Share and Create QR Code items. r=Standard8,urlbar-reviewers,fluent-reviewers,bolsson\"\n\nThis reverts commit 73b615eabb462135b47b45d7932da265735d2d49.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2009747 - Patch 2 - Update the picker's Copy Link to support sharing multiple links. r=mac-reviewers,bradwerth\"\n\nThis reverts commit 46401e316e65899987d845b3c053358de74f6455.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2009747 - Patch 1 - Replace the deprecated NSSharingService enumeration with NSSharingServicePicker. r=mac-reviewers,fluent-reviewers,desktop-theme-reviewers,hjones,bradwerth,bolsson\"\n\nThis reverts commit 9387bb66c8d86356549dcf5277b6090332fe75c9.\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/test/browser-contextMenu/browser.toml", "browser/base/content/test/browser-contextMenu/browser_contextmenu_share_macosx.js", "browser/base/content/test/browser-menubar/browser_file_share_macosx.js", "browser/components/customizableui/CustomizableWidgets.sys.mjs", "browser/components/customizableui/test/browser_share_tab_button_macosx.js", "browser/components/qrcode/test/browser/browser_qrcode_share_menu.js", "browser/components/sharing/SharingUtils.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/content/UrlbarInputBase.mjs", "browser/locales/en-US/browser/browser.ftl", "browser/locales/en-US/browser/menubar.ftl", "browser/modules/BrowserUsageTelemetry.sys.mjs", "browser/themes/shared/browser-shared.css", "widget/cocoa/MOZShareURLPasteboardItem.h", "widget/cocoa/MOZShareURLPasteboardItem.mm", "widget/cocoa/moz.build", "widget/cocoa/nsMacSharingCopyOverride.h", "widget/cocoa/nsMacSharingCopyOverride.mm", "widget/cocoa/nsMacSharingService.mm", "widget/nsIMacSharingService.idl", "widget/tests/gtest/TestMOZShareURLPasteboardItem.mm", "widget/tests/gtest/moz.build", "widget/tests/unit/test_macsharingservice.js", "widget/tests/unit/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": "a63d3c0a256d1d18086c2841c9bff1b68cd47760", "git_parents": ["5b0fe7ab55cec9c69342b72439d04ec359b96de1"], "node": "ee0c526355276b5ca8bc7673d75084dd864ba092", "parents": ["e8c16426ab1a58e88bb4b26e1fcdebf91cde9c02"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Silaghi \u003casilaghi@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2074193 - HTMLOptionsCollection could use similar setup to SetAttr when it comes to script blockers, r=farre\" for causing browser chrome