mmit 408c0488f50a1b35a56c6561cd2aeaf4695be52d.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2075001 - Add a pref to enforce widget market gating on Nightly r=reemhamz\"\n\nThis reverts commit 12ad59ecce8c86508b6b8851967e9b51d5ec5350.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2066245 - Make Crossword available to English locales outside PL, off by default r=reemhamz\"\n\nThis reverts commit fecc41615f94b337b45d1908a409a37a1219a435.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2074974 - Turn Recent Searches widget off by default for all regions r=reemhamz\"\n\nThis reverts commit afd16432c09ae7ddbe0a2bd3fafa0fab7461cbc6.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2066247 - Turn Stocks widget off by default for all regions r=reemhamz\"\n\nThis reverts commit 8b80c4a136764a3cdce50e295a559cad6925f10c.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2066248 - Turn Privacy widget off by default for all regions. r=maxx\"\n\nThis reverts commit 0cbf500520186d01291262fd4f5ab6205cc3eb64.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2066246 - Turn POTD widget off by default for US, DE, FR, PL regions. r=maxx\"\n\nThis reverts commit 176fb01597ffde3e24e4261a9678c81b5a59880a.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2066244 - Turn Clocks widget off by default for US, DE, FR, PL regions. r=maxx\"\n\nThis reverts commit c1b94c3b58ae7fe0e9c8c2724228da52724c85c4.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2066242 - Turn FocusTimer off by default in US, DE, FR, PL regions. r=maxx\"\n\nThis reverts commit 1e425296589c495e41533e246244a1fd02b6a759.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2066240 - Turn the Lists widget off by default in the US, DE and FR, and block it in PL r=reemhamz\"\n\nThis reverts commit 541999fd5257fcfc7f82bef7d8479f0a46eabda1.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2066236 - Gate widget availability by market r=reemhamz\"\n\nThis reverts commit d3ae9c59045f125917f35515b7e8771560af3158.\n", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "browser/components/preferences/tests/home/browser_homepage_firefox_home.js", "browser/extensions/newtab/common/WidgetsRegistry.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/lib/ActivityStream.sys.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/lib/PrefsFeed.sys.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/browser/browser_discovery_card.js", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/browser/browser_newtab_side_by_side_layout.js", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/components/Widgets/WidgetsRegistry.test.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/lib/ActivityStream.test.js", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/lib/PrefsFeed.test.js", "testing/profiles/common/user.js", "testing/profiles/xpcshell/user.js"], "git_node": "18d9efd53b34d51f3be66cb66de39ad3cbaa6fb9", "git_parents": ["865f6920cc66c5068c632019455ef63d93319771"], "node": "a72269cf0415a8d963d21e68ea3f5539464d80ca", "parents": ["373ecac9dc78c0db1499b18176543bafab39b022"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790330113, "git_changesets": ["18d9efd53b34d51f3be66cb66de39ad3cbaa6fb9"], "user": "asilaghi@mozilla.com"}, "45422": {"changesets": [{"author": "Hiroyuki Ikezoe \u003chikezoe.birchill@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2013264 - Expand the fixed viewport and the scroll range while the software keyboard is visible. r=botond,geckoview-reviewers,layout-reviewers,emilio,owlish\n\nThis ensures that when the visual viewport is scrolled to the bottom of\nthe layout viewport and the software keyboard is visible, bottom-fixed\nelements are aligned with the bottom of the visual viewport.\n\n`fixedElementRectOnCollapsedToolbarWithKeyboardOnResizesVisual` is for\nthe change in PresShell::GetFixedViewportSize.\n`fixedElementWithKeyboardOnResizesVisual` is for the change in\nExpandHeightForDynamicToolbarImpl. Though the latter also depends on the\nformer change.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324450\n", "files": ["layout/base/PresShell.cpp", "layout/base/nsLayoutUtils.cpp", "layout/base/nsPresContext.cpp", "layout/base/nsPresContext.h", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/test/InteractiveWidgetTest.kt"], "git_node": "16c48ac514b53b21d6955ebd1d4458c78410da3e", "git_parents": ["f0df024a1defb4742eb1e06046cc95224e041c93"], "node": "9c07fc8cb94c3d46adba559cd13eec069a84fb05", "parents": ["163949a6b19ca2a73cf90f77b9868ef6dda03a5f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Hiroyuki Ikezoe \u003chikezoe.birchill@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2013264 - Move position:fixed content while the dynamic toolbar is in transition with the software keyboard visible. r=botond,geckoview-reviewers,owlish\n\nComputeFixedMarginsOffset refused to compensate for the dynamic toolbar offset\nwhenever the software keyboard was visible outside resizes-content. The main\nthread doesn't reposition position:fixed content until the toolbar is fully\ncollapsed, so while the toolbar is in transition the compositor is the only\nthing that can move it, and suppressing that leaves a blank strip the size of\nthe part of the toolbar that has already gone away.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324451\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/apz/src/APZCTreeManager.cpp", "gfx/layers/apz/src/APZCTreeManager.h", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/test/InteractiveWidgetTest.kt"], "git_node": "4916396a4538dea42a66cf860831b1215fbbc5c2", "git_parents": ["16c48ac514b53b21d6955ebd1d4458c78410da3e"], "node": "58161085fd12344272f0ed2785c057a580d53112", "parents": ["9c07fc8cb94c3d46adba559cd13eec069a84fb05"], "tags": []}, {"author": "mcarare \u003c48995920+mcarare@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2010612 - Remove redundant withContext calls and simplify coroutine handling. r=android-reviewers,nalexander\n\n- Remove unnecessary withContext wrappers in RegionManager, RegionMiddleware, DefaultCreditCardValidationDelegate, DefaultTabGroupRepository, PlayStoreReviewPromptController, SupportedAddonsWorker, and EmailMaskPromptViewListener, as underlying suspend calls are already main-thread safe.\n- Fix NestedBlockDepth in SupportedAddonsWorker.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324047\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/addons/migration/SupportedAddonsChecker.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/prompts/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/prompts/emailmask/EmailMaskPromptViewListener.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/tabgroups-storage/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/tabgroups/storage/repository/TabGroupRepository.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/tabgroups-storage/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/tabgroups/storage/repository/DefaultTabGroupRepositoryTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/tabgroups-storage/src/testFixtures/kotlin/mozilla/components/feature/tabgroups/storage/repository/TabGroupRepositoryTestFixtures.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/service/sync-autofill/src/main/java/mozilla/components/service/sync/autofill/DefaultCreditCardValidationDelegate.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/service/sync-autofill/src/main/java/mozilla/components/service/sync/autofill/GeckoCreditCardsAddressesStorageDelegate.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/service/sync-autofill/src/test/java/mozilla/components/service/sync/autofill/GeckoCreditCardsAddressesStorageDelegateTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/samples/sync/src/main/java/org/mozilla/samples/sync/MainActivity.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/HomeActivity.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/browser/BaseBrowserFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/PlayStoreReviewPromptController.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/library/history/HistoryFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/PlayStoreReviewPromptControllerTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/collections/migration/CollectionsToTabGroupsMigrationIntegrationTest.kt"], "git_node": "36406e434f3c98870c7afe0d94a82b24677c37cd", "git_parents": ["4916396a4538dea42a66cf860831b1215fbbc5c2"], "node": "68a534f39f4d936e854be887ac75e1139207714c", "parents": ["58161085fd12344272f0ed2785c057a580d53112"], "tags": []}, {"author": "mcarare \u003c48995920+mcarare@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2010612 - Make suspend updateProviderList main-thread safe. r=android-reviewers,nalexander\n\nMove I/O dispatching for SERP provider updates into SerpTelemetryRepository.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324048\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/search/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/search/telemetry/SerpTelemetryRepository.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/Core.kt", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/focus/telemetry/GleanMetricsService.kt"], "git_node": "14a1f6ac219f7a34409aaf71c85e92a8cf22a5c6", "git_parents": ["36406e434f3c98870c7afe0d94a82b24677c37cd"], "node": "088539aff408976d67aa579e209f08a654c81ba1", "parents": ["68a534f39f4d936e854be887ac75e1139207714c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "mcarare \u003c48995920+mcarare@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2010612 - Make suspend getAddonByID main-thread safe. r=android-reviewers,nalexander\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324049\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/addons/amo/AMOAddonsProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/metrics/RtamoAttributionHandler.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/onboarding/OnboardingFragment.kt"], "git_node": "f7b8db46c1e28059ba0f9513a858344ba2c76d73", "git_parents": ["14a1f6ac219f7a34409aaf71c85e92a8cf22a5c6"], "node": "32b28cab830e61dd270c72f7d0672804582ea651", "parents": ["088539aff408976d67aa579e209f08a654c81ba1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "AndiAJ \u003candiaj@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070825 - Fix installPWAFromTheMainMenuTest efficiency UI test r=jajohnson\n\nThe UI test was flaky when trying to click the home screen shortcut.\n\nClicking a UiObject on a still-animating screen (the launcher settling a freshly-added home-screen shortcut) failed intermittently, because the code called exists(). (a single instantaneous check that throws if the node flickers out in the gap between resolving and acting on it)\n\nTo fix this, I've replaced exists() with waitForExists(waitingTimeShort) in both the click and long click UiObject, so the click smoothly handles a brief miss so it won't crash or throw.\n\nThe UI test successfully passed 50x on Firebase \u2705\nAll UI test successfully passed 1x on Firebase \u2705\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328834\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/core/UiActions.kt"], "git_node": "e72c8a6830f0ea04c91cc72a91480e82db799b96", "git_parents": ["f7b8db46c1e28059ba0f9513a858344ba2c76d73"], "node": "b38ae11dda50d51842eb61e1b7b3dcd804e2a980", "parents": ["32b28cab830e61dd270c72f7d0672804582ea651"], "tags": []}, {"author": "AndiAJ \u003candiaj@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066127 - Fix audioVideoPermissionWithoutRememberingTheDecisionTest efficiency UI test r=aaronmt\n\nThe UI test was flaky when tapping the \u201cDon\u2019t allow\u201d button.\n\nTapping the permission dialog\u2019s \u201cDon\u2019t allow\u201d button actually worked (the dialog closed and the page showed \u201cCamera and Microphone not allowed\u201d), but the old click method waited for a confirmation signal that a self-closing dialog never sends, so it wrongly reported the click as failed.\n\nTo fix this I've switched the allow/deny dialog buttons to the UiObject2 click, which just performs the tap without waiting for that confirmation, so the click no longer reports a false failure.\n\nThe UI test successfully passed 50x on Firebase \u2705\nAll UI test successfully passed 1x on Firebase \u2705\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328835\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/selectors/SitePermissionsSelectors.kt"], "git_node": "44eec7885f9b0cc9590ac1a4400224497fcc2785", "git_parents": ["e72c8a6830f0ea04c91cc72a91480e82db799b96"], "node": "77d377fdcc0dc771e6fb94a1721d19dbc059f14f", "parents": ["b38ae11dda50d51842eb61e1b7b3dcd804e2a980"], "tags": []}, {"author": "AndiAJ \u003candiaj@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075192 - Convert verifyGeneralSettingsItemsTest regression UI test to the efficiency framework r=aaronmt\n\nThe UI test successfully passed 25 on Firebase \u2705\nAll UI tests successfully passed 1x on Firebase \u2705\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328824\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/SettingsGeneralTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/selectors/SettingsSelectors.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/tests/SettingsGeneralTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/tests/SettingsTest.kt"], "git_node": "1fed5644168475e7e703fc0a2148a39a10218613", "git_parents": ["44eec7885f9b0cc9590ac1a4400224497fcc2785"], "node": "c9023d50db8bd03c8e8b04695ad9bf85ec13d436", "parents": ["77d377fdcc0dc771e6fb94a1721d19dbc059f14f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "AndiAJ \u003candiaj@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074094 - Convert verifySearchSettingsMenuItemsTest regression UI test to the efficiency framework r=jajohnson\n\nThe UI test successfully passed 25x on Firebase \u2705\nAll UI tests successfully passed 1x on Firebase \u2705\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327804\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/SettingsSearchTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/core/Relations.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/helpers/BasePage.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/selectors/SettingsSearchSelectors.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/tests/SettingsSearchTest.kt"], "git_node": "49fc46218d7e35929153099846934c0a453c27e8", "git_parents": ["1fed5644168475e7e703fc0a2148a39a10218613"], "node": "ce54fd906e25806d8565d2779fbc32b70d091211", "parents": ["c9023d50db8bd03c8e8b04695ad9bf85ec13d436"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072294 - Don't make urlbar shadow purple on the native theme / forced-colors. r=urlbar-reviewers,desktop-theme-reviewers,mstriemer,dao\n\nAlso make the code below actually target HCM / forced colors.\n\nIt's dubious to make the urlbar purple for themes, btw...\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326229\n", "files": ["browser/themes/shared/urlbar.css"], "git_node": "5ac9cd7dc4e6c692366a00a83828152fdce887db", "git_parents": ["49fc46218d7e35929153099846934c0a453c27e8"], "node": "ab66a0f481c64ed025c4d87f43b51563a2bc47a4", "parents": ["ce54fd906e25806d8565d2779fbc32b70d091211"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Silaghi \u003casilaghi@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2066127, Bug 2070825 - Fix audioVideoPermissionWithoutRememberingTheDecisionTest efficiency UI test r=aaronmt\" for causing android fenix lints failures at SitePermissionsSelectors.kt\n\nThis reverts commit 44eec7885f9b0cc9590ac1a4400224497fcc2785.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2070825 - Fix installPWAFromTheMainMenuTest efficiency UI test r=jajohnson\"\n\nThis reverts commit e72c8a6830f0ea04c91cc72a91480e82db799b96.\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/core/UiActions.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/selectors/SitePermissionsSelectors.kt"], "git_node": "00ec4d9e0b8b6056b1c24e6937c900879eb53771", "git_parents": ["5ac9cd7dc4e6c692366a00a83828152fdce887db"], "node": "19c908261a687e4b98681de7e327da5505919322", "parents": ["ab66a0f481c64ed025c4d87f43b51563a2bc47a4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jens Stutte \u003cjstutte@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2071720 - Deliver macOS gamepad input from a blocking run loop instead of polling every 50 ms. r=jesup\n\nIOKit posts gamepad input to a per-client queue and signals the run loop\nthe IOHIDManager is scheduled on. The monitor thread only pumped that run\nloop with a zero timeout once every 50 ms, so every event that arrived in\nbetween sat in the queue and a press and release inside one window were\nforwarded back to back. A page sampling getGamepads() per frame could not\nobserve the button as pressed.\n\nBlock in the run loop instead, so callbacks fire as soon as IOKit posts\nthem. Shutdown() stops the loop through a retained CFRunLoopRef, which is\nthe fix for the crash in bug 1347519 that motivated the polling design.\nEach pass is bounded by a one second timeout and re-checks the running\nflag, so a stop request that raced with entering the loop cannot hang\nthread shutdown.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327242\n", "files": ["dom/gamepad/cocoa/CocoaGamepad.cpp"], "git_node": "3f77df27474cf0980bd87b3fdb4f2d09e0f24147", "git_parents": ["00ec4d9e0b8b6056b1c24e6937c900879eb53771"], "node": "212455529bcb0ab37bf7a344916bf9bfe78ac355", "parents": ["19c908261a687e4b98681de7e327da5505919322"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Bumping Firefox l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD CLOSED TREE\n\nach -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\naf -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nan -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nar -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nast -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\naz -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nbe -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nbg -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nbn -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nbo -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nbqi -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nbr -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nbrx -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nbs -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nca -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nca-valencia -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\ncak -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nckb -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\ncs -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\ncy -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nda -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nde -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\ndsb -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nel -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nen-CA -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nen-GB -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\neo -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nes-AR -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nes-CL -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nes-ES -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nes-MX -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\net -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\neu -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nfa -\u003e 1039b110ae767298c6de1c7b9db320454525e3e6\nff -\u003e 1039b1