e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069109: Add text block component for AITab r=mlucks,omarg\n\nFigma: https://www.figma.com/design/sIgXsbSFZjKIcfErMoBgLr/Smart-Window-Q3?node-id=16774-24497&m=dev\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328241\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-website-chip/ai-website-chip.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/aitab-page/aitab-base.css", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/aitab-page/aitab-page.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/aitab-page/aitab-text-block/aitab-text-block.css", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/aitab-page/aitab-text-block/aitab-text-block.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/aitab-page/aitab-text-block/aitab-text-block.stories.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/jar.mn", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_aitab_blocks.js"], "git_node": "88e3ab1dae4f25f61cfc408efed43540be7f6652", "git_parents": ["63aaea311e6c3ad73a39fe96d245ee0941f33680"], "node": "cce3486b8db35c243fe7a9a45e9ae8e91d30e681", "parents": ["197423b948a3284aa05e31498d468a1539f2083e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075643 - Link the macOS OpenH264 plugin with lld instead of the cctools-port ld64. r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,ahochheiden\n\nThe cctools-port ld64 cannot read the .tbd stubs of newer macOS SDKs, while every other macOS toolchain\nalready links with lld. The plugin target links with the C++ compiler and runs no other cctools tool, so the\ncctools fetch goes away as well.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329243\n", "files": ["taskcluster/kinds/openh264-plugin/kind.yml", "taskcluster/scripts/openh264/build.sh"], "git_node": "8af047a0eeec1c069af5c8890489132c15d6ea37", "git_parents": ["88e3ab1dae4f25f61cfc408efed43540be7f6652"], "node": "7a0ab25eb62708fb864484c28cc23045606f9c05", "parents": ["cce3486b8db35c243fe7a9a45e9ae8e91d30e681"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075644 - Only pass compiler-rt's DARWIN cmake variables to the compiler-rt build. r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,ahochheiden\n\nOnly compiler-rt reads the DARWIN_* variables and CMAKE_LIPO; cmake warns about them as unused in every clang\nstage and llvm-symbolizer configure.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329244\n", "files": ["build/build-clang/build-clang.py", "taskcluster/scripts/misc/build-llvm-common.sh"], "git_node": "73b45908f1eeafb685b1dcae6892d034e7eb6723", "git_parents": ["8af047a0eeec1c069af5c8890489132c15d6ea37"], "node": "4cdae7b18da8363fc09c6e810cb500d73e07e6f7", "parents": ["7a0ab25eb62708fb864484c28cc23045606f9c05"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Giulia Cardieri \u003cgcardieri@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058135: Fix button ghost text color on HCM mode r=desktop-theme-reviewers,reusable-components-reviewers,mkennedy,dao,thecount,yjamora\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327971\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/styles/nova/_tokens.scss", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/dist/nova/tokens-figma-theme.json", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/dist/semantic-categories.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/dist/tokens-shared.css", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/dist/tokens-table.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/src/tokens/components/button.tokens.json"], "git_node": "4b5107059dadbd41df8e3057b33acaa32abead23", "git_parents": ["73b45908f1eeafb685b1dcae6892d034e7eb6723"], "node": "a254540eef65db2ff74ac86c5d72c627e845c876", "parents": ["4cdae7b18da8363fc09c6e810cb500d73e07e6f7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Hynson \u003cmhynson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072404 - Fix split view tab height in compact mode with vertical tabs. r=tabbrow