abricator.services.mozilla.com/D329168\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/pdfjs/test/browser_pdfjs_fill_login.js"], "git_node": "1259f3c4171c49d86c9967856562384e2964071f", "git_parents": ["f75d2534768031bdfdbed65d8de22e374f843f9b"], "node": "225a8772d3d01f060a978c876038e56ddfbef3b7", "parents": ["406b5fe94e6cebf51dfbce091805feb03bc04040"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Florian Qu\u00e8ze \u003cflorian@queze.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075369 - Release the right mouse button when opening context menus in password manager and about:logins tests, r=credential-management-reviewers,mtigley.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329165\n", "files": ["browser/components/aboutlogins/tests/browser/browser_contextmenuFillLogins.js", "toolkit/components/passwordmgr/test/browser/browser_context_menu.js", "toolkit/components/passwordmgr/test/browser/browser_context_menu_autocomplete_interaction.js", "toolkit/components/passwordmgr/test/browser/head.js"], "git_node": "274bc48f115a1173df350dfd0fb1b5600ebbb3e3", "git_parents": ["1259f3c4171c49d86c9967856562384e2964071f"], "node": "4383c818bb8b9b7c5e31331dd66e968063b40cc7", "parents": ["225a8772d3d01f060a978c876038e56ddfbef3b7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Florian Qu\u00e8ze \u003cflorian@queze.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075369 - Release the right mouse button when opening context menus in the extensions test helpers, r=extension-reviewers,robwu.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329163\n", "files": ["browser/components/extensions/test/browser/browser_ext_menus_incognito.js", "browser/components/extensions/test/browser/head.js"], "git_node": "a213aab737f20b5f52539eed133f302cb4e778dd", "git_parents": ["274bc48f115a1173df350dfd0fb1b5600ebbb3e3"], "node": "b74712d9bdb6e7943ebec2dc042adafe848d1688", "parents": ["4383c818bb8b9b7c5e31331dd66e968063b40cc7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075651 - Use strong stack references in ContentParent timer callbacks. r=dom-core-reviewers,smaug\n\nThe two timer callbacks in ContentParent use NS_NewTimerWithFuncCallback,\nwhich passes in a ContentParent* as a void* closure argument. This does not\nresult in a use-after-free because the timers are cancelled in the ContentParent\ndestructor.\n\nThis does mean that when we run the timer callbacks we aren't guaranteed\nto have a strong stack reference to the ContentParent. This is probably\nfine because lots of things keep it alive, but let's be safe and add\na strong stack reference in both callback methods.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329337\n", "files": ["dom/ipc/ContentParent.cpp"], "git_node": "7dae74ec0a7461994e756f0592ded41fc738366d", "git_parents": ["a213aab737f20b5f52539eed133f302cb4e778dd"], "node": "37f6d9dc5a82fa322172a21eaf386ba8c14a4644", "parents": ["b74712d9bdb6e7943ebec2dc042adafe848d1688"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075651 - Hold more strong references in nsBrowserStatusFilter. r=dom-core-reviewers,smaug\n\nMake these less sketchy.\n\nAlso, recheck the listener in CallDelayedProgressListeners(), in\ncase it got cleared by the OnStatusChange call in MaybeSendStatus().\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329338\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/statusfilter/nsBrowserStatusFilter.cpp"], "git_node": "0b25d9f259ae03e961832eff7bd5fc42fb3c904d", "git_parents": ["7dae74ec0a7461994e756f0592ded41fc738366d"], "node": "5f9ad00d4c4eb89a68d8641ec101d4a87f841b24", "parents": ["37f6d9dc5a82fa322172a21eaf386ba8c14a4644"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075651 - Use multiline ifs in nsBrowserStatusFilter. r=dom-core-reviewers,smaug\n\nI noticed this while looking at this file and it was causing me pain.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329339\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/statusfilter/nsBrowserStatusFilter.cpp"], "git_node": "c04fa187afd6f8c693850486eba728389a6784de", "git_parents": ["0b25d9f259ae03e961832eff7bd5fc42fb3c904d"], "node": "731f6ddcbbc8ef0a9d232a519b2e29e1d6cf39e0", "parents": ["5f9ad00d4c4eb89a68d8641ec101d4a87f841b24"], "tags": []}, {"author": "longsonr \u003clongsonr@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067969 - Fix accumulation for single values with repeat count and set tangent of zero length path to zero r=emilio\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329246\n", "files": ["dom/smil/SMILAnimationFunction.cpp", "dom/smil/SMILAnimationFunction.h", "dom/smil/test/db_smilAnimateMotion.js", "dom/svg/SVGMotionSMILAnimationFunction.h", "dom/svg/SVGMotionSMILType.cpp", "testing/web-platform/meta/svg/animations/animateMotion-from-to-rotate-auto-no-motion.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/svg/animations/animateMotion-path-moveto-only.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/svg/animations/animateMotion-path-zero-length-subpaths.html.ini"], "git_node": "aa9c36288cd4df0ab837328b178fd126fc4afc50", "git_parents": ["c04fa187afd6f8c693850486eba728389a6784de"], "node": "9c936e8ad21b6350f1f631a3c8feadb70ade9ed6", "parents": ["731f6ddcbbc8ef0a9d232a519b2e29e1d6cf39e0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dale Harvey \u003cdale@arandomurl.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074292 - Use moz-src for browser/components/referrals r=settings-reviewers,hjones,omc-reviewers,emcminn\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327981\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/aboutDialog.js", "browser/base/content/browser-sets.js", "browser/base/content/browser-sync.js", "browser/base/content/browser.js", "browser/base/content/utilityOverlay.js", "browser/components/preferences/config/account-sync.mjs", "browser/components/referrals/moz.build", "browser/components/referra