in the existing HSL/HWB match arm and factor missing-component bits into ColorFlags::NONE_FLAGS.\n\nUpdate WPT expected serialization for nested HSL/HWB colors with missing components, and remove only expected-failure annotations for passing cases. Preserve annotations for origin-channel cases that still fail.\n\nVerified a Firefox binaries build and the full css-color/parsing WPT directory: 46 tests, 12,135 subtests, 0 unexpected results.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329463\n", "files": ["servo/components/style/color/color_function.rs", "servo/components/style/color/mod.rs", "servo/components/style/color/to_css.rs", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-color/parsing/color-computed-hsl.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-color/parsing/color-computed-hwb.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-color/parsing/color-computed-relative-color.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-color/parsing/color-valid-hsl.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-color/parsing/color-valid-hwb.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-color/parsing/color-valid-color-mix-function.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-color/parsing/color-valid-relative-color.html"], "git_node": "8627f40f47db245282696da313107f3475f62cda", "git_parents": ["5c11ff23933ed8ab9178199960f8b8fbf5cde705"], "node": "adaa2d50c98c1e612152a64e98225160487ff5f3", "parents": ["bba3024b3fc4bb90abaa6cbaaa7ecfee7816834e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lars Eggert \u003clars@eggert.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075184 - Read objdir and srcdir from the environment in mozbuild. r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,crashreporting-reviewers,ahochheiden\n\nKeeps checkout paths out of the mozbuild rlib so Rust compile caches can be shared across checkouts.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328854\n", "files": ["build/rust/mozbuild/generate_buildconfig.py", "build/rust/mozbuild/lib.rs", "build/rust/mozbuild/moz.buil