a\nreal status code, instead of being stupid and always returning 0.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329310\n", "files": ["js/src/builtin/TestingFunctions.cpp", "js/src/jit-test/etc/wasm/Makefile", "js/src/jit-test/etc/wasm/README.md", "js/src/jit-test/etc/wasm/generate-and-patch.sh", "js/src/jit-test/etc/wasm/generate-spectests/Cargo.lock", "js/src/jit-test/etc/wasm/generate-spectests/README.md", "js/src/jit-test/etc/wasm/generate-spectests/src/main.rs", "js/src/jit-test/etc/wasm/generate-spectests/wast2js/Cargo.toml", "js/src/jit-test/etc/wasm/generate-spectests/wast2js/src/convert.rs", "js/src/jit-test/etc/wasm/generate-spectests/wast2js/src/harness.js"], "git_node": "c310fc2efe408ca80a207e99f51d2d90fda0d9df", "git_parents": ["009bf0e6332a05aee829185032368f84ddb3b448"], "node": "b0c2db35d7e0248874ff3cb7899d87b5137a196a", "parents": ["d280a492b234a37550b135ed149841bac85bd523"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ben Visness \u003cbvisness@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073580: Add extended-name-section spec tests. r=yury\n\nAlso moved one of Yury's tests out of the spec test folder since it was\nincorrectly placed there.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329311\n", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/etc/wasm/generate-spectests/config-lock.toml", "js/src/jit-test/etc/wasm/generate-spectests/config.toml", "js/src/jit-test/etc/wasm/spec-tests.patch", "js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/spec/compact-import-section/harness/harness.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/spec/custom-page-sizes/harness/harness.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/spec/extended-name-section/directives.txt", "js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/spec/extended-name-section/harness/directives.txt", "js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/spec/extended-name-section/harness/harness.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/spec/extended-name-section/name.wast.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/spec/spec/custom_annot.wast.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/spec/spec/harness/harness.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/spec/spec/instance.wast.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/spec/stack-switching/cross-module-cont-new.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/spec/stack-switching/harness/harness.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/spec/threads/harness/harness.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/spec/wide-arithmetic/harness/harness.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/stack-switching/cross-module-cont-new.js"], "git_node": "1380b234bf6e5d6fe7c319a8c01549cf59dae5bb", "git_parents": ["c310fc2efe408ca80a207e99f51d2d90fda0d9df"], "node": "018cebda61c8a29897e19cc1a608abe83727ff63", "parents": ["b0c2db35d7e0248874ff3cb7899d87b5137a196a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "nhadji \u003cnhadji@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076101 - Default run-on-repo-type in the test transforms, r=taskgraph-reviewers,ahal\n\nmake_job_description reads task[\"run-on-repo-type\"] directly, which only\nworks because kinds/test/kind.yml sets it in task-defaults. Default it in\nset_defaults like run-on-projects, so test kinds can drop the hg-only\nguard without failing to load. No behavior change while the guard is in\nplace: full taskgraph generation produces an identical task set.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329556\n", "files": ["taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/transforms/test/__init__.py"], "git_node": "f22555ce0640cceca59eac8cbbdd7d66dc93a168", "git_parents": ["1380b234bf6e5d6fe7c319a8c01549cf59dae5bb"], "node": "c66a581aba27ad4d0811d5feadc426280b3577a0", "parents": ["018cebda61c8a29897e19cc1a608abe83727ff63"], "tags": []}, {"author": "nhadji \u003cnhadji@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076101 - Only set clone-with in the condprof transform when the kind defines it, r=taskgraph-reviewers,ahal\n\nThe condprof transform rebuilds the run section and copies\ntask[\"run\"][\"clone-with\"] unconditionally, so removing the hg-only\nclone-with guard from the kind makes the graph fail to generate. Copy the\nkey only when present and let run-task defaults apply otherwise. No\nbehavior change while the guard is in place.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329557\n", "files": ["taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/transforms/condprof.py"], "git_node": "8ad2b7945cae7c1834969b590c946b4ff17109c7", "git_parents": ["f22555ce0640cceca59eac8cbbdd7d66dc93a168"], "node": "7748cd71e1d3998911ebe5574f1b900bdb56b80f", "parents": ["c66a581aba27ad4d0811d5feadc426280b3577a0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dale Harvey \u003cdale@arandomurl.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074288 - Use moz-src for browser/components/taskbartabs r=tabbrowser-reviewers,sclements,omc-reviewers,emcminn\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327974\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/browser.js", "browser/components/BrowserComponents.manifest", "browser/components/asrouter/modules/ASRouterTargeting.sys.mjs", "browser/components/asrouter/tests/browser/browser_asrouter_targeting.js", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/browser_window_features_mismatch_telemetry.js", "browser/components/tabbrowser/Tabbrowser.sys.mjs", "browser/components/taskbartabs/TaskbarTabs.sys.mjs", "browser/components/taskbartabs/TaskbarTabsCmd.sys.mjs", "browser/components/taskbartabs/TaskbarTabsPageAction.sys.mjs", "browser/components/taskbartabs/TaskbarTabsPin.sys.mjs", "browser/components/taskbartabs/TaskbarTabsWindowManager.sys.mjs", "browser/components/taskbartabs/components.conf", "browser/components/taskbartabs/moz.build", "browser/components/taskbartabs/test/browser/browser_taskbarTabs_cmd.js", "browser/components/taskbartabs/test/browser/browser_taskbarTabs_content.js", "browser/components/taskbartabs/test/browser/browser_taskbarTabs_icons.js", "browser/components/taskbartabs/test/browser/browser_taskbarTabs_manifest.js", "browser/components/taskbartabs/test/browser/browser_taskbarTabs_nimbus.js", "browser/components/taskbartabs/test/browser/browser_taskbarTabs_pageAction.js", "