E a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "d55e93f7e5f63569e3754f00c9ada81acb44c793", "git_parents": ["473db1d81ebc5a67f6d303aac6c971cb4a820118"], "node": "caa53e93dd1b0ca44bc2ce1342c5003c7f2a23ea", "parents": ["ac1eb80ce36291bbb87e874bdc7a04c87120ca01"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790685834, "git_changesets": ["d55e93f7e5f63569e3754f00c9ada81acb44c793"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "45444": {"changesets": [{"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073864 - Give Inspect Accessibility Properties in the content context menu the accesskey y. r=firefox-desktop-core-reviewers ,fluent-reviewers,flod,Gijs\n\nThis item only shows for DevTools users. It shares y with Copy Image on images and canvases, where the key cycles between the two.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329385\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/browser-context.inc.xhtml", "browser/locales/en-US/browser/browserContext.ftl"], "git_node": "2ca0ee69e928a4c19dd64e3f1588cd9396d64db9", "git_parents": ["ab8d6c5ccc0df56b48c3416e2e6f6e596fd2e6f2"], "node": "4fdf1f5f21c8568503c82d902000e08db0ef05ed", "parents": ["20198ebaa1b4f06c69b453336c4d1128e471ee73"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075554 - Make the design system's test runner wait for its tests before reporting. r=hjones,reusable-components-reviewers,desktop-theme-reviewers\n\nEach test is async, so runTests counted every pending Promise as a pass and the job could only fail through its TEST-UNEXPECTED-FAIL lines.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329152\n", "files": ["toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/tests/try-runner.js"], "git_node": "89a0ab788083d1841c80107f032e51c91dae2e07", "git_parents": ["2ca0ee69e928a4c19dd64e3f1588cd9396d64db9"], "node": "52c62665d32cfb8abd334ef259e9115a149393e4", "parents": ["4fdf1f5f21c8568503c82d902000e08db0ef05ed"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075554 - Add the missing text color tokens for background variants, and test that none goes missing again. r=hjones,desktop-theme-reviewers,reusable-components-reviewers\n\nThe new tokens alias their component's base text color, so the sweep renders nothing differently: the two panel sites sit in arrow panels, which do not redefine --panel-text-color, and the urlbar box text color is inherit. With every variant paired, the rule's suggestion to fall back to the base text color can no longer fire, so it goes.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329153\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/test/browser-static/browser_parsable_css.js", "browser/themes/shared/UITour.css", "browser/themes/shared/downloads/downloads.inc.css", "browser/themes/shared/urlbar.css", "browser/themes/shared/urlbar/dynamic-results.css", "browser/themes/shared/urlbar/urlbar.tokens.css", "browser/themes/shared/urlbar/urlbar.tokens.json", "browser/themes/shared/urlbar/view-nova.css", "browser/themes/shared/urlbar/view-proton.css", "docs/code-quality/lint/linters/stylelint-plugin-mozilla/rules/use-paired-color-tokens.md", "toolkit/content/widgets/moz-message-bar/moz-message-bar.css", "toolkit/content/widgets/moz-message-bar/moz-message-bar.tokens.css", "toolkit/content/widgets/moz-message-bar/moz-message-bar.tokens.json", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/dist/semantic-categories.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/dist/tokens-figma-primitives.json", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/dist/tokens-figma-theme.json", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/dist/tokens-shared.css", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/dist/tokens-table.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/src/tokens/components/panel.nova.tokens.json", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/src/tokens/components/panel.tokens.json", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/tests/tr