obbe\n\nAdd an `allowRedeclaringExistingLexicalBinding` option to the Debugger\neval APIs. When you set a `let` or `const` binding in the global lexical\nenvironment, it can be reinitialized by a later evaluation instead of\nthrowing a redeclaration error.\n\nThis only covers the top-level (global lexical) case.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326431\n", "files": ["devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/_jsterm.toml", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/browser_jsterm_redeclare_let_const.js", "devtools/server/actors/webconsole/eval-with-debugger.js", "js/public/CompileOptions.h", "js/src/debugger/Debugger.cpp", "js/src/debugger/Debugger.h", "js/src/debugger/Frame.cpp", "js/src/doc/Debugger/Debugger.Object.md", "js/src/jit-test/tests/debug/Object-executeInGlobal-10.js", "js/src/jsapi.cpp", "js/src/vm/EnvironmentObject.cpp", "js/src/vm/JSScript.cpp", "js/src/vm/ObjectFuse.cpp", "js/src/vm/ObjectFuse.h", "js/src/vm/SharedStencil.h", "js/src/vm/StencilEnums.h", "js/src/vm/Watchtower.cpp", "js/src/vm/Watchtower.h"], "git_node": "2787d68374d61010e913997d5488d3b64ae0b568", "git_parents": ["5652fa431b5406cc1f4a4638a0a2480504870c6d"], "node": "771d2b338b9d6ebd8ee6fda2917cb93c213596c3", "parents": ["2d4bbdcdd7a0b276f32c9dbfa959cbfec37206d4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jari Jalkanen \u003cjjalkanen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076677: Force GC/CC while waiting for cleanup in test_caches_delete_cleanup_after_shutdown.py. r=dom-storage-reviewers,dom-worker-reviewers,edenchuang\n\nThe freed database pages are only vacuumed when the Cache connection closes,\nwhich requires the Cache object returned by openCache to be collected first.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329992\n", "files": ["dom/cache/test/marionette/test_caches_delete_cleanup_after_shutdown.py"], "git_node": "6514031a0addf855b7ebda215d0500b15aeec8d4", "git_parents": ["2787d68374d61010e913997d5488d3b64ae0b568"], "node