 \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075536 [wpt PR 62957] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62957\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-tables/caption-orthogonal-block-start-margin.html.ini"], "git_node": "9f4c44baa93c488cd571dfce217d3b189ef70a19", "git_parents": ["8a51e46e43022330d9e87f8324afe1f3967a5b9a"], "node": "d609146c3485884cbfad1a845e84404fe742b055", "parents": ["ecc6fe3aebdf8daa99831d8508ab208d4be42d67"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Romain Menke \u003c11521496+romainmenke@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075532 [wpt PR 62956] - [css-values-4] extra coverage for `log/exp/pow/sqrt/hypot/round` with `NaN` and `infinity` values, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[css-values-4] extra coverage for `log/exp/pow/sqrt/hypot/round` with `NaN` and `infinity` values (#62956)\n--\n\nwpt-commits: ab1720909f26f5799f683b55d31534c4a1475c4f\nwpt-pr: 62956\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-values/exp-log-compute.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-values/hypot-pow-sqrt-computed.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-values/round-function.html"], "git_node": "66c9c99b083f70b09b5708d04ae5ab8b2125da46", "git_parents": ["9f4c44baa93c488cd571dfce217d3b189ef70a19"], "node": "105bbc45ea69627f4e9a35a74f9068652aedf985", "parents": ["d609146c3485884cbfad1a845e84404fe742b055"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075532 [wpt PR 62956] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62956\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-values/exp-log-compute.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-values/hypot-pow-sqrt-computed.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-values/random-computed.tentative.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-values/round-function.html.ini"], "git_node": "882351e4162c7295128975b3d5444279e3bcb553", "git_parents": ["66c9c99b083f70b09b5708d04ae5ab8b2125da46"], "node": "2d13192abfb92d3170f70556ab80c8eccdf31f90", "parents": ["105bbc45ea69627f4e9a35a74f9068652aedf985"], "tags": []}, {"author": "David Baron \u003cdbaron@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075474 [wpt PR 62953] - Stop supporting ::interest-button pseudo-element on \u003cmenuitem\u003e., a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nStop supporting ::interest-button pseudo-element on \u003cmenuitem\u003e.\n\nHTML \u003cmenuitem\u003e elements are implicit interest invokers.  This makes\nthem no longer support the ::interest-button pseudo-element unless\nthey're explicitly (via the interestfor attribute) interest invokers.\n\nBug: 406566432, 453705247\nChange-Id: Iff25143126a8d954249eb4f78e11bddf85c07cf6\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8463902\nCommit-Queue: David Baron \u003cdbaron@chromium.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Mason Freed \u003cmasonf@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1704576}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: ac5cb6332ab18803ead57e5f3728634d4474f59c\nwpt-pr: 62953\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/semantics/menu/tentative/menuitem-no-interest-button-pseudo.html"], "git_node": "d45daedf2d6fce9d0e8b72e385a0cde52d84f033", "git_parents": ["882351e4162c7295128975b3d5444279e3bcb553"], "node": "7aa524389645e2f0a792574edb2d31fe681cf523", "parents": ["2d13192abfb92d3170f70556ab80c8eccdf31f90"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075474 [wpt PR 62953] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62953\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/html/semantics/menu/tentative/menuitem-no-interest-button-pseudo.html.ini"], "git_node": "0e919fb8f0e4d344f08817365ee91f10b768c7fb", "git_parents": ["d45daedf2d6fce9d0e8b72e385a0cde52d84f033"], "node": "d685ea9cc3217a8f4c8c927444bb443ff97847f8", "parents": ["7aa524389645e2f0a792574edb2d31fe681cf523"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Byungwoo Lee \u003cblee@igalia.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075489 [wpt PR 62937] - Fix flaky securitypolicyviolation tests, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nFix flaky securitypolicyviolation tests\n\nDispatching of a CSP violation event during HTML parsing can race with\na test's EventWatcher setup if the setup happens after the markup that\nintroduces the violation.\n\nFix the flaky test by moving EventWatcher setup into an earlier script\nblock, before the violating markup, and apply the approach to other\ntests with the same issue.\n\nTest results:\n- https://ci.chromium.org/ui/inv/u-blee-2026-09-24-08-24-00-c385873d39153a17\n- https://ci.chromium.org/ui/inv/u-blee-2026-09-24-08-55-00-4597efd6435557ac\n- https://ci.chromium.org/ui/inv/u-blee-2026-09-24-09-39-00-79a68238abe6838c\n- https://ci.chromium.org/ui/inv/u-blee-2026-09-24-09-52-00-f2f3f96acff6aaf0\n\nBug: 559396684\nForce-WPT-Export: true\nChange-Id: Iacae4e491b7f2229f4185021f8b71ed4523274f2\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8460902\nReviewed-by: Kentaro Hara \u003charaken@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Byungwoo Lee \u003cblee@igalia.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1704579}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 219a539451aec63bf5b17d2e34069e1f5502acde\nwpt-pr: 62937\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/content-security-policy/securitypolicyviolation/targeting-for-inline-handler-in-markup-then-disconnected.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/content-security-policy/securitypolicyviolation/targeting-for-inline-handler-in-markup.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/content-security-policy/securitypolicyviolation/targeting-for-inline-script-without-nonce.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/content-security-policy/securitypolicyviolation/targeting-for-inline-style.html"], "git_node": "48b963983d2ebbab5417c0a65cb25643c35086ac", "git_parents": ["0e919fb8f0e4d344f08817365ee91f10b768c7fb"], "node": "cfe5350b05977ad126330946b0a820dbabf950d7", "parents": ["d685ea9cc3217a8f4c8c927444bb443ff97847f8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan Qin \u003cryqin@google.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075459 [wpt PR 62945] - [EVP] Add initial WPT test coverage for Email Verification Token, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[EVP] Add initial WPT test coverage for Email Verification Token\n\nAdds initial Web Platform Test coverage for the Email Verification\nProtocol (EVP) / Email Verification Token (EVT) flow.\n\nIncludes:\n- Helper functions in fedcm-helper.sub.js for setting up EVT endpoints\n  and asserting token verification results.\n- Basic test in external/wpt/fedcm/fedcm-delegation/evt-basic.https.html.\n- Mock support endpoints for issuance and JWKS.\n- Virtual test suite configuration in VirtualTestSuites.\n- Filter in chrome.filter for chrome_wpt_tests runner.\n- DNS TXT resolver URL prefix override support in DnsRequest.\n\nBug: 558631116\nChange-Id: I0941cf459a45a926d1b03439abfe38c793b2d1cc\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8395828\nReviewed-by: Christian Biesinger \u003ccbiesinger@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Ryan Qin \u003cryqin@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1704840}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 161df5f6191f4709857377421fa7c1684b15850a\nwpt-pr: 62945\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/fedcm/fedcm-delegation/evt-basic.https.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/fedcm/support/delegation-dns.py", "testing/web-platform/tests/fedcm/support/delegation-issuance.py", "testing/web-platform/tests/fedcm/support/delegation-jwks.py", "testing/web-platform/tests/fedcm/support/fedcm-helper.sub.js"], "git_node": "ad6e98e4421811b8d3a24aed2838ba05f8c6d5e2", "git_parents": ["48b963983d2ebbab5417c0a65cb25643c35086ac"], "node": "fe33aa66563433e7b104bfd7962a6d750c6a7aa9", "parents": ["cfe5350b05977ad126330946b0a820dbabf950d7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075459 [wpt PR 62945] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62945\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/fedcm/fedcm-delegation/evt-basic.https.html.ini"], "git_node": "dfe3994da3ffbfb3f598d746bca282803e27c557", "git_parents": ["ad6e98e4421811b8d3a24aed2838ba05f8c6d5e2"], "node": "a6503b36845119c47180e95c256c360d26512bc0", "parents": ["fe33aa66563433e7b104bfd7962a6d750c6a7aa9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Fernando Fiori \u003cffiori@microsoft.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075460 [wpt PR 62946] - Remove void element end tags from css-view-transitions WPTs, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nRemove void element end tags from css-view-transitions WPTs\n\ninput and link have no end tag. Writing \u003c/link\u003e or \u003c/input\u003e anyway is a\nparse error, and the parser drops the tag. This CL removes those end\ntags from wpt/css/css-view-transitions/.\n\nBug: 542686202\nChange-Id: I225ae418f341ce27002b187266d73f6435abb93f\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8222444\nReviewed-by: Fernando Fiori \u003cffiori@microsoft.com\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Fernando Fiori \u003cffiori@microsoft.com\u003e\nAuto-Submit: Fernando Fiori \u003cffiori@microsoft.com\u003e\nReviewed-by: Brandon Walderman \u003cbrwalder@microsoft.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1704864}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: ec045886be6767b59f45fc7351c04cfd4f273727\nwpt-pr: 62946\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/adjust-transform-with-scale.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/adjust-transform.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/compute-explicit-name-direct.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/compute-explicit-name-nested-vt-names.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/compute-explicit-name-nested.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/compute-explicit-name-non-ancestor.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/compute-explicit-name-non-existent.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/compute-explicit-name-self.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/contain-direct.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/contain-nested.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/contain-on-self.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/custom-ident-implies-contain.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/nearest-direct.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/nearest-ignores-nearest-name.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/nearest-implies-contain.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/nearest-nested.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/nested-exit.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/nested-group-display-none.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/nested-group-in-pseudo-basic.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/nested-root-capture-with-clip-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/nested-root-capture-with-clip.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/normal-goes-up.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/nested/render-element.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/shared-transition-author-style.manual.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/shared-transition-half.manual.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/shared-transition-shapes.manual.html"], "git_node": "6a8d6e814486731c60754ae67404a630236af1dc", "git_parents": ["dfe3994da3ffbfb3f598d746bca282803e27c557"], "node": "1f80a32cbbaedc33a24780f7e7208fc9e6b3a783", "parents": ["a6503b36845119c47180e95c256c360d26512bc0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jacques Newman \u003cjanewman@microsoft.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075472 [wpt PR 62952] - [focusgroupV2] Restore feed WPT state after mutation, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[focusgroupV2] Restore feed WPT state after mutation\n\nRestore feed-navigation test state after its dynamic mutation case so a\nfailure cannot leak inserted or removed elements into later tests. Both\nFocusgroup V2 review stacks depend on this shared WPT prerequisite.\n\nBug: 445992558\nChange-Id: Iad1e30771cf5436353944c79d27a57ca14d49974\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8408771\nReviewed-by: Jeff Weiner \u003cJeff.Weiner@microsoft.com\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Jacques Newman \u003cjanewman@microsoft.com\u003e\nAuto-Submit: Jacques Newman \u003cjanewman@microsoft.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1704965}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 19eb5e044815d17c63533a3717f68d661c4e61c1\nwpt-pr: 62952\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/interaction/focus/focusgroup/tentative/feed-navigation.html"], "git_node": "a0a55ed1ebc5c2fdd192dd5765f3afbe05967b74", "git_parents": ["6a8d6e814486731c60754ae67404a630236af1dc"], "node": "22bbca26efc9e438add233cb74d153041c40867b", "parents": ["1f80a32cbbaedc33a24780f7e7208fc9e6b3a783"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Fernando Fiori \u003cffiori@microsoft.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075760 [wpt PR 62971] - Fix mismatched end tags in css-text-decor WPTs, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nFix mismatched end tags in css-text-decor WPTs\n\nIn these tests the closing tag names a different element than the one\nactually open. Correct each end tag, and close elements the source\nclearly meant to close.\n\nBug: 542686202\nChange-Id: I47c3582af00fc233ef325c6237a162d033227adf\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8227204\nCommit-Queue: Fernando Fiori \u003cffiori@microsoft.com\u003e\nAuto-Submit: Fernando Fiori \u003cffiori@microsoft.com\u003e\nReviewed-by: Andres Regalado Rosas \u003candresrega@microsoft.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1704979}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: e2c6b9c04b336c4158e2babdd6874df6b12be8c5\nwpt-pr: 62971\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text-decor/reference/text-emphasis-style-002-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text-decor/reference/text-emphasis-style-010-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text-decor/reference/text-emphasis-style-012-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text-decor/text-decoration-040-manual.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text-decor/text-decoration-090a-manual.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text-decor/text-decoration-091a-manual.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text-decor/text-decoration-092a-manual.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text-decor/text-decoration-095a-manual.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text-decor/text-decoration-096a-manual.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text-decor/text-decoration-097a-manual.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text-decor/text-decoration-line-040-manual.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text-decor/text-decoration-line-090a-manual.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text-decor/text-decoration-line-091a-manual.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text-decor/text-decoration-line-092a-manual.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text-decor/text-decoration-line-095a-manual.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text-decor/text-decoration-line-096a-manual.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text-decor/text-decoration-line-097a-manual.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text-decor/text-decoration-propagation-04.html"], "git_node": "675e3d2085da966c3ddee4ecca9e35ffe52d11a4", "git_parents": ["a0a55ed1ebc5c2fdd192dd5765f3afbe05967b74"], "node": "b366da8c8a84bdf0f12546f7a4c541e2a1f93bb6", "parents": ["22bbca26efc9e438add233cb74d153041c40867b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Fernando Fiori \u003cffiori@microsoft.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075767 [wpt PR 62975] - Fix mismatched end tags in HTML WPTs, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nFix mismatched end tags in HTML WPTs\n\nIn these tests in third_party/blink/web_tests/external/wpt/html/ the\nclosing tag names a different element than the one actually open.\nCorrect each end tag, and close elements the source clearly meant to\nclose rather than relying on an ancestor's end tag to do it.\n\nBug: 542686202\nChange-Id: Ifb22d0448f785b432104d4612e130fac06868f28\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8222504\nReviewed-by: Jacques Newman \u003cjanewman@microsoft.com\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Fernando Fiori \u003cffiori@microsoft.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1705005}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 46a30f4889a0a1ba3916fcb0b14d282b9e0c9da5\nwpt-pr: 62975\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/element/manual/filters/svg-specular-filter-visited-color-taints.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/editing/dnd/events/relatedTarget-attribute-manual.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/editing/dnd/platform/modifiers/copy.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/editing/dnd/platform/modifiers/copylink.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/editing/dnd/platform/modifiers/copymove.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/editing/dnd/platform/modifiers/link.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/editing/dnd/platform/modifiers/linkmove.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/editing/dnd/platform/modifiers/move.html", "testi