 \u003cjtracey@thunderbird.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2077209 - Add MOZ_TOPSRCDIR to Cargo env. r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,ahochheiden\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D330172\n", "files": ["python/mozbuild/mozbuild/rust_commands.py"], "git_node": "f57ca83eabd19aeb06d3810b9142d2eb3d42e552", "git_parents": ["020b0af5c7435caea7d1d1898a76e5a9a7379819"], "node": "bc9bee3d768c57cf725fc5dee6675a5fa338cdfb", "parents": ["c53789202c153565f404c43596a7a34718e9e6a8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Aaditya Dhingra \u003cadhingra@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076202 - Remove source-test-android-lint task from CI as mozlint-android replaces it. r=tcampbell,bhearsum,nalexander\n\nWe moved `lintDebug` task to project linters in [lints.py](https://searchfox.org/firefox-main/rev/eb8ceeebe16204dabfc82bd9673a09e3db4d0217/tools/lint/android/lints.py#152-184) which is run in [mozlint-android.yml](https://searchfox.org/firefox-main/rev/eb8ceeebe16204dabfc82bd9673a09e3db4d0217/taskcluster/kinds/source-test/mozlint-android.yml#123) so we can remove [source-test-android-lint.yml](https://searchfox.org/firefox-main/rev/eb8ceeebe16204dabfc82bd9673a09e3db4d0217/taskcluster/kinds/source-test/android-lint.yml) now\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329614\n", "files": ["taskcluster/kinds/source-test/android-lint.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/source-test/kind.yml"], "git_node": "9b3db0dbac9fac8cc77dfae47cd114c42915bba3", "git_parents": ["f57ca83eabd19aeb06d3810b9142d2eb3d42e552"], "node": "f94c997cc7fa1650e59f6adc3e945caef6a6aefa", "parents": ["bc9bee3d768c57cf725fc5dee6675a5fa338cdfb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Maxx Crawford \u003cmcrawford@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2077234 - Add a pref to turn on widget market gating r=nina-py\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D330209\n", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "browser/extensions/newtab/lib/ActivityStream.sys.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/lib/ActivityStream.test.js"], "git_node": "3bfd8f7875b0d5185ae92c280062ef3fed1b1951", "git_parents": ["9b3db0dbac9fac8cc77dfae47cd114c42915bba3"], "node": "a981e6f8232c228b6dc965cd43fa0ac43440277d", "parents": ["f94c997cc7fa1650e59f6adc3e945caef6a6aefa"], "tags": []}, {"author": "scottdowne \u003csdowne@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076846 - Removing newtab hideTopSitesTitle pref from activityStream r=ini,dao\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D330011\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/CollapsibleSection/CollapsibleSection.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/lib/ActivityStream.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "9d616b4f64a63e8c1e235494a6aed2b64c93cb8e", "git_parents": ["3bfd8f7875b0d5185ae92c280062ef3fed1b1951"], "node": "630145276fb6968ac858257e7350259799ec5702", "parents": ["a981e6f8232c228b6dc965cd43fa0ac43440277d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Markus Stange \u003cmstange.moz@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074617 - Update profiler toolchain revision. r=perftest-reviewers,kshampur\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328242\n", "files": ["taskcluster/kinds/fetch/toolchains.yml"], "git_node": "35944e2aecc5b8d99ef780ee17557b5db6506fb7", "git_parents": ["9d616b4f64a63e8c1e235494a6aed2b64c93cb8e"], "node": "af785e488c57321516afbed49eafa47c9ef86339", "parents": ["630145276fb6968ac858257e7350259799ec5702"], "tags": []}, {"author": "kpatenio \u003ckpatenio@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074722 - trim browser_bookmarks_sidebar.js and split into new test files drag_and_drop.js, smart_bookmarks.js, and truncation.js r=sidebar-reviewers,nsharpley\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328598\n", "files": ["browser/components/sidebar/tests/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/sidebar/tests/browser/browser_bookmarks_sidebar.js", "browser/components/sidebar/tests/browser/browser_bookmarks_sidebar_drag_and_drop.js", "browser/components/sidebar/tests/browser/browser_bookmarks_sidebar_smart_bookmarks.js", "browser/components/sidebar/tests/browser/browser_bookmarks_sidebar_truncation.js"], "git_node": "0fc55a83b414da9fcb3f7296b2700b0e6efc5c24", "git_parents": ["35944e2aecc5b8d99ef780ee17557b5db6506fb7"], "node": "1ed4f62fdd2af560e17bb41cc4ab3c7f2ae9b47a", "parents": ["af785e488c57321516afbed49eafa47c9ef86339"], "tags": []}, {"author": "calu \u003ccalu@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2046581 - Cancel the download service's coroutine scope on destroy r=android-reviewers,sfamisa\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328139\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/downloads/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/downloads/AbstractFetchDownloadService.kt"], "git_node": "d910cbb14699540d6adbe2ba36ba087d4aeef65f", "git_parents": ["0fc55a83b414da9fcb3f7296b2700b0e6efc5c24"], "node": "0153af2839edb0bbdb6f26e50f4be99ca313fe2b", "parents": ["1ed4f62fdd2af560e17bb41cc4ab3c7f2ae9b47a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Julien Cristau \u003cjcristau@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076539 - Part 1 - Don't use sccache for try artifact builds. r=taskgraph-reviewers,hneiva\n\nArtifact builds don't compile anything, so starting an sccache server,\nfetching the sccache toolchain and granting access to the sccache buckets\nis wasted effort.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329815\n", "files": ["taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/test/test_transforms_build.py", "taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/transforms/build.py"], "git_node": "5e261539d78bdd63e548e2b8b99bb00d99c08d84", "git_parents": ["d910cbb14699540d6adbe2ba36ba087d4aeef65f"], "node": "beac4eb9654ec4d906dab5b52a933bb1054e066a", "parents": ["0153af2839edb0bbdb6f26e50f4be99ca313fe2b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Julien Cristau \u003cjcristau@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076539 - Part 2 - Don't fetch compile toolchains for try artifact builds. r=taskgraph-reviewers,hneiva\n\nTry artifact builds kept all the toolchains of the build they replace,\nincluding compilers, sysroots and SDKs they don't use, and the ONNX\nruntime, which they get from the upstream build like the rest of the\nbinaries. Besides the download and unpacking time, depending on those\ntoolchains means waiting for them to be rebuilt when they change.\n\nWith this, the linux64, macosx64 and win64 artifact builds fetch the\nsame toolchains as the corresponding artifact-build tasks.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329816\n", "files": ["taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/test/test_transforms_build.py", "taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/transforms/build.py"], "git_node": "9d28e6d5ed22cdf3abb689517356f3be8297a745", "git_parents": ["5e261539d78bdd63e548e2b8b99bb00d99c08d84"], "node": "7616e81a120753b3b581935a2437c76e97ec8359", "parents": ["beac4eb9654ec4d906dab5b52a933bb1054e066a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Johan Lorenzo \u003cjlorenzo@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073020 - Disable decision task perfherder alerts outside the gecko trust domain r=taskgraph-reviewers,sparky,ahal DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329721\n", "files": ["taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/decision.py", "taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/test/test_decision.py", "taskcluster/mach_commands.py"], "git_node": "658dad456166a7c1a44e45dd7932d68a5f378827", "git_parents": ["9d28e6d5ed22cdf3abb689517356f3be8297a745"], "node": "975d0efdb6f90baada5ef80a518dd31d22e84543", "parents": ["7616e81a120753b3b581935a2437c76e97ec8359"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Danielle Graham \u003cdgraham@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074710 - Allow List All Tabs group list to coexist with application menu tab groups list r=sthompson,tabbrowser-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329249\n", "files": ["browser/components/tabbrowser/GroupsList.sys.mjs", "browser/components/tabbrowser/content/browser-allTabsMenu.js", "browser/components/tabbrowser/test/browser/tabs/browser_tab_manager_groups.js"], "git_node": "854d3e5e021db9f6d1a62c71f94585724de0af70", "git_parents": ["658dad456166a7c1a44e45dd7932d68a5f378827"], "node": "4aa26dd044eb8143ad8daffd931868b3409a57a7", "parents": ["975d0efdb6f90baada5ef80a518dd31d22e84543"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jan-Niklas Jaeschke \u003cjjaschke@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053240 - Derive initial synced field values in the parent process r=nika\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315047\n", "files": ["docshell/base/BrowsingContext.cpp", "docshell/base/BrowsingContext.h", "docshell/base/SyncedContext.h", "docshell/base/SyncedContextInlines.h", "dom/ipc/BrowserParent.cpp", "dom/ipc/ContentParent.cpp", "dom/ipc/WindowGlobalActor.cpp", "dom/ipc/WindowGlobalActor.h", "dom/ipc/WindowGlobalParent.cpp", "dom/ipc/WindowGlobalParent.h"], "git_node": "2335ef39b6a42febce70ac44e61453a75844c73b", "git_parents": ["854d3e5e021db9f6d1a62c71f94585724de0af70"], "node": "7f4e8fa2f6e99a499e0d13c426b729adefa79a26", "parents": ["4aa26dd044eb8143ad8daffd931868b3409a57a7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Danielle Graham \u003cdgraham@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2048803 - toggle tab group menu icon src for nova. r=sthompson,desktop-theme-reviewers,tabbrowser-reviewers,dao\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327924\n", "files": ["browser/themes/shared/jar.inc.mn", "browser/themes/shared/tabbrowser/tab-group-label-22.svg", "browser/themes/shared/tabbrowser/tab-groups-list.css"], "git_node": "3ba81bc5230b7e300d7aa1786af15c0b94348cb3", "git_parents": ["2335ef39b6a42febce70ac44e61453a75844c73b"], "node": "bcf01a952c27557f2c0332e0ccfcb9741e07e022", "parents": ["7f4e8fa2f6e99a499e0d13c426b729adefa79a26"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075403 - Remove useless assignment in AboutDebuggingRegistration. r=devtools-reviewers,nchevobbe\n\nThis call returns an nsFileChannel, which is not an nsJSChannel, which\nis the channel that has an owner property. This is just setting an\nexpando property right now.\n\nThis was found while looking into bug 2075403, but shouldn't change\nbehavior in any case, nor is a fix for that.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329055\n", "files": ["devtools/startup/AboutDebuggingRegistration.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "f44cc3ee3faeb70d2be26bc06ac1691b89d84ccb", "git_parents": ["3ba81bc5230b7e300d7aa1786af15c0b94348cb3"], "node": "c02df66a91eadd1bb4348abe216e99d81e93229a", "parents": ["bcf01a952c27557f2c0332e0ccfcb9741e07e022"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790890830, "git_changesets": ["ce9c5cc2745e38393019103e5c86fea87ce5c1d2", "541495e265ec04c44518e9beee1ff8a9a15d8d3d", "00f863ad7091c618c50ac42b11a7ccbf60354ff7", "4a61df7976f3b02b66cf487816538a80e8b2a28a", "471985ecd522622a9d01eef561c2097f3d8108ce", "281b985a90968e0e309a383163ccb12f61a6033f", "e170de1998a2912181fec2cc994623b11ba90918", "6d95c518a75c8eebc4221da327f736d10a66f2c5", "635794860d63b0e58869478052e28ca705bea795", "228840f836cf1a4b01af9f38f8f86da803c0691b", "e74efacf35a6a95d31855066b0c2b273d98b1b99", "ef73b2bc1045ffedcebdb78ce14f10d6b94bc5e2", "b6e86598fad7eb55b581149308886c927aa1269d", "9b10dc6ce678bb5155e2f21994d27562f5ee0818", "0b32deef55891fd8ef5a4d3d8f1c481b383f4d87", "46e483a3e541740e033dbea6659e2d66b980646d", "5c474c28403c33e8bbd10b6a0917521d3ee3a041", "322968e479e5bab81eed9e906b8596b68a1d69e7", "5eeab21d43fe797f050e2f884a6a77f7184d4c65", "6533429e55d354605d6daa4a04d7acab09e8c8ed", "1beb3ab4b13d36642b695708049186158ebb876e", "902d619f95867c1399a4dd34f18017328bc7cf0b", "28e77fd80150bb1ec9dbce06e8606dbe5283fa9f", "c976374a08f7c5605b297c8a2258ae9f31d01c8d", "d