ver wrapped, so the table grew\nwider than the page and scrolled sideways.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328962\n", "files": ["toolkit/content/license.html.mako", "toolkit/themes/shared/aboutLicense.css"], "git_node": "4e130ec94bdde34b4de4bce8f3e90de0cc29ca4c", "git_parents": ["d60ebb90570b5148c9566dd1eb57d718af7dc8f6"], "node": "0ddadfe1ce7c74e6eef80df2a780b3ec2b9f008c", "parents": ["60fb3354b7e8ab70c74751de6f69df75aae209a1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075334 - Keep a license's name and paths in view on about:license r=desktop-theme-reviewers,dao\n\nSome license texts run for thousands of pixels, leaving the name and the\npaths they cover far above the text being read.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328963\n", "files": ["toolkit/content/license.html.mako", "toolkit/themes/shared/aboutLicense.css"], "git_node": "0021f5957690a5daab41c4a852265cd10101c4cb", "git_parents": ["4e130ec94bdde34b4de4bce8f3e90de0cc29ca4c"], "node": "78c4ca1650587f177db6332714122cd80c83c675", "parents": ["0ddadfe1ce7c74e6eef80df2a780b3ec2b9f008c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075334 - Show the about:license index in columns r=desktop-theme-reviewers,dao\n\nThe index of about ninety licenses ran as a single column below a tall\nillustration, so the first license was several screens down.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328964\n", "files": ["toolkit/content/license.html.mako", "toolkit/themes/shared/aboutLicense.css"], "git_node": "5eb3311b6e5dda740912e3503b112a891a7b8a2d", "git_parents": ["0021f5957690a5daab41c4a852265cd10101c4cb"], "node": "93b878804d76ab4511aa91e30ec06a89d9489683", "parents": ["78c4ca1650587f177db6332714122cd80c83c675"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075334 - Skip the paths list when the about:license notice names them all r=desktop-theme-reviewers,dao\n\nMost notices already say which directory they cover, so the list below\nonly repeated it.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328965\n", "files": ["toolkit/content/gen_license_html.py", "toolkit/content/license.html.mako", "toolkit/themes/shared/aboutLicense.css"], "git_node": "8e719975da54c26616b76dc4479d04105be7a92d", "git_parents": ["5eb3311b6e5dda740912e3503b112a891a7b8a2d"], "node": "d1ce9f3aed2f848915ac4a1d0b988578910d0eb4", "parents": ["93b878804d76ab4511aa91e30ec06a89d9489683"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075334 - Use one top-level heading on about:license r=desktop-theme-reviewers,dao\n\nEvery license name and notice section was an h1, alongside the page title.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328966\n", "files": ["toolkit/content/license.html.mako", "toolkit/content/licenses/mpl.html", "toolkit/themes/shared/aboutLicense.css"], "git_node": "e93e62096b88edccccd78449fb4cacf7916ccbe1", "git_parents": ["8e719975da54c26616b76dc4479d04105be7a92d"], "node": "98722c49c71908dca1766bd680ea4e94810cc53c", "parents": ["d1ce9f3aed2f848915ac4a1d0b988578910d0eb4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075334 - Update the stale acknowledgements on about:license\n\nThe C++ Big Integer Library is no longer in the tree. The FreeType credit\nnamed an OS/2 port Firefox no longer has and years a decade out of date;\nonly Android builds FreeType from the tree, with the years of the vendored\nrelease.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328967\n", "files": ["toolkit/content/license.html.mako"], "git_node": "1309c4cfe0f45332e16669fffaa9377a28a1bff6", "git_parents": ["e93e62096b88edccccd78449fb4cacf7916ccbe1"], "node": "4723449df02912eb40a4483575de37904e392983", "parents": ["98722c49c71908dca1766bd680ea4e94810cc53c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075334 - List the store trademarks apart from the software notices on about:license\n\nThey are there for the store badges the product shows, not for any code\nit ships.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328968\n", "files": ["toolkit/content/license.html.mako"], "git_node": "8f1d523454550cda03cc5220ba8c284d810d7536", "git_parents": ["1309c4cfe0f45332e16669fffaa9377a28a1bff6"], "node": "c5d0e350b8e31699e322b7ce3fc281c0514d0c90", "parents": ["4723449df02912eb40a4483575de37904e392983"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075334 - Add an acknowledgement field to the LICENSES moz.build variable r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,ahochheiden\n\nThe credits under \"Other Required Notices\" and \"Optional Notices\" are\nwritten into the template, so they show on every build, whether it ships\nthe code or not. Carried by the license declaration instead, a credit only\nappears where that directory is built, like the license notices.\n\nThe two sections become one \"Acknowledgements\" section: a required credit\nis met wherever it appears on the page, so nothing depends on the split.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328969\n", "files": ["python/mozbuild/mozbuild/frontend/context.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/frontend/data.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/licenses.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test/backend/data/licenses/lib/moz.build", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test/backend/test_recursivemake.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test/frontend/data/licenses/lib/moz.build", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test/frontend/test_emitter.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test/test_license_collection.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/vendor/docs/licensing.md", "toolkit/content/gen_license_html.py", "toolkit/content/license.html.mako"], "git_node": "4a115dd896d86611afabe888423ec6d6acadbdf1", "git_parents": ["8f1d523454550cda03cc5220ba8c284d810d7536"], "node": "bf83b4095e939278e78d6dadb77fd829dcfa4008", "parents": ["c5d0e350b8e31699e322b7ce3fc281c0514d0c90"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-central repo-update remote-settings ct-logs - r=release-managers,RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D330620\n", "files": ["security/ct/CTKnownLogs.h", "security/manager/tools/log_list.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": "4878e77256a2744ef1429246a23a40a18188a96e", "git_parents": ["4a115dd896d86611afabe888423ec6d6acadbdf1"], "node": "171b9e71f7879d5fbd90ac2ea086375cacb0c3f6", "parents": ["bf83b4095e939278e78d6dadb77fd829dcfa4008"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alex Hochheiden \u003cahochheiden@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2060428 - Part 12 - Remove the legacy Cargo invocation r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,sergesanspaille\n\nEvery Rust recipe runs the run_cargo action, which composes the environment\nand arguments from configure, and `mach cargo` always goes through\n`rust_commands.py` as well. rust.mk keeps what the action does not cover: the\ndependency rule that decides whether to run at all, the test library staging,\nand the networking check on release libraries.\n\n`MSYS2_ENV_CONV_EXCL` is no longer exported. It kept msys2 from rewriting a\n`\u003cwrapper\u003e \u003ccompiler\u003e` value in `CC_*` and `CXX_*` when the recipe shell started\nCargo, and the action now sets those variables after that shell. Configure no\nlonger sets `MOZ_FPU` and `HOST_LINKER_LIBPATHS_BAT`, which nothing reads.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325637\n", "files": ["build/moz.configure/arm.configure", "build/moz.configure/flags.configure", "config/config.mk", "config/makefiles/rust.mk", "moz.configure", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/backend/recursivemake.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/mach_commands.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/rust_commands.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test/backend/test_recursivemake.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test/test_mach_cargo.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test/test_rust_commands.py"], "git_node": "be32552acda4a03ee240e82005b0458a70fe41e3", "git_parents": ["4878e77256a2744ef1429246a23a40a18188a96e"], "node": "82067bd7ea8fac26cee552ccf1524717cad3e403", "parents": ["171b9e71f7879d5fbd90ac2ea086375cacb0c3f6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Edgar Chen \u003cechen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2077980 - Don't throw an error when setting nsIFilePicker.displayDirectory to a non-readable directory; r=emilio,smaug\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D330619\n", "files": ["widget/nsBaseFilePicker.cpp"], "git_node": "e22cf72e6ce3381ba345e1986a89d7371d552de0", "git_parents": ["be32552acda4a03ee240e82005b0458a70fe41e3"], "node": "6ca4f8ee1dae5ad0af9328c0a6ad7dcbf298703d", "parents": ["82067bd7ea8fac26cee552ccf1524717cad3e403"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sotaro Ikeda \u003csotaro.ikeda.g@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2077889 - Remove RenderExternalTextureHost r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman\n\npref gfx.webrender.enable-client-storage is false in current m-c. And RenderExternalTextureHost could not be used with ANGLE metal since Bug 2054038 fix.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D330601\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/composite/TextureHost.cpp", "gfx/layers/composite/TextureHost.h", "gfx/layers/opengl/CompositorOGL.cpp", "gfx/layers/opengl/TextureHostOGL.cpp", "gfx/layers/opengl/TextureHostOGL.h", "gfx/webrender_bindings/RenderExternalTextureHost.cpp", "gfx/webrender_bindings/RenderExternalTextureHost.h", "gfx/webrender_bindings/moz.build", "modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml"], "git_node": "63f1a659b30d8827af728e325031411db4ff34cc", "git_parents": ["e22cf72e6ce3381ba345e1986a89d7371d552de0"], "node": "a77e43325df1423b4444d566254f6742830983a2", "parents": ["6ca4f8ee1dae5ad0af9328c0a6ad7dcbf298703d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Import translations from https://github.com/mozilla-l10n/android-l10n CLOSED TREE\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/errorpages/src/main/res/values-th/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/awesomebar/src/main/res/values-th/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-th/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/main/res/values-co/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-es-rMX/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-is/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-th/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/prompts/src/main/res/values-de/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-co/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-cs/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-es-rMX/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-is/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-th/strings.xml"], "git_node": "9b17359563517ea6dca4d12badaa88dba1f4b601", "git_parents": ["63f1a659b30d8827af728e325031411db4ff34cc"], "node": "7b7d91b7115e5d286e5f0cb6f89c44f0c556215a", "parents": ["a77e43325df1423b4444d566254f6742830983a2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": 