the shared WPT suite\n\nSigned-off-by: mxmgorin \u003c102797145+mxmgorin@users.noreply.github.com\u003e\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 856693a2063c88c51cdc1f3c48c9f53d86fc5151\nwpt-pr: 62992\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/webgl/framebuffer-initial-state.html"], "git_node": "8b7104f2520d6e5e878cc350bece9896b71fe761", "git_parents": ["da24c7ee28e128d11237bd9c35bff5bba7927dbd"], "node": "a7c35786b3a7135878e5e688b064bdf73d28e841", "parents": ["fb26c94e88dd2f0d9d33befa446ac3d5d6cadc7a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Fran\u00e7ois Beaufort \u003cbeaufort.francois@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075934 [wpt PR 62995] - [WebMCP] Add document.modelContext.ontoolcancel attribute, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[WebMCP] Add document.modelContext.ontoolcancel attribute\n\nontoolactivated and ontoolcancel attributes now supersede WebMCPEvents,\nwhich are slated for removal in a future CL.\n\nSpec PR: https://github.com/webmachinelearning/webmcp/pull/146\n\nBug: 489045948\nChange-Id: I2fc110b7979baecc752663e7d9b2fd4ba51d4cbf\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/7653555\nReviewed-by: Dominic Farolino \u003cdom@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Fr \u003cbeaufort.francois@gmail.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1705650}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 2d66b9b7998bb58c336138c178323ddee857b586\nwpt-pr: 62995\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/webmcp/declarative/executeTool-abort.https.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webmcp/imperative/executeTool-abort.https.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webmcp/imperative/executeTool-detach-toolcancel.https.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webmcp/imperative/executeTool-events.https.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webmcp/tool-cancel-event.https.html"], "git_node": "a90b03fe3d9b189ba15aa5cccb724a5f3ea8dd8b", "git_parents": ["8b7104f2520d6e5e878cc350bece9896b71fe761"], "node": "f5c9441b609ac4d134a35e35097b9da1ea92d18b", "parents": ["a7c35786b3a7135878e5