ttributes on the \u003ca\u003e element, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nmathml: Add tests for MathML style attributes on the \u003ca\u003e element\n\nCovers displaystyle, mathbackground, mathcolor and mathsize.\nRelated to w3c/mathml-core#340.\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: f73126ab943ef9baf2f60219e0cb625a9d50c345\nwpt-pr: 63056\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/mathml/relations/css-styling/anchor-displaystyle-001-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/mathml/relations/css-styling/anchor-displaystyle-001.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/mathml/relations/css-styling/anchor-mathbackground-001-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/mathml/relations/css-styling/anchor-mathbackground-001.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/mathml/relations/css-styling/anchor-mathcolor-001-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/mathml/relations/css-styling/anchor-mathcolor-001.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/mathml/relations/css-styling/anchor-mathsize-001-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/mathml/relations/css-styling/anchor-mathsize-001.html"], "git_node": "cd46f4282beae9369d67aafec25bb2cf46ba62f9", "git_parents": ["dd7504f09cc08e7d4b52db384f1002499db2f68e"], "node": "24c0960fe6bcf9225b88e7af2498de4eaa754c44", "parents": ["68455e0c8a5b87b4bc06c519782276f4fd484074"], "tags": []}, {"author": "mxmgorin \u003c102797145+mxmgorin@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076226 [wpt PR 63020] - webgl: Present the canvas after blitFramebuffer and clearBuffer, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nwebgl: Present the canvas after blitFramebuffer and clearBuffer\n\nSigned-off-by: mxmgorin \u003c102797145+mxmgorin@users.noreply.github.com\u003e\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 8098ac6612d6be3e9512f984919f0f3e27146405\nwpt-pr: 63020\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/webgl/blitFramebuffer-presents-drawing-buffer.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webgl/clearBufferfv-presents-drawing-buffer.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webgl/drawing-buffer-presented-ref.html"], "git_node": "ccc510a7775018dd7e73775d9bf197bc5892c966", "git_parents": ["cd46f4282beae9369d67aafec25bb2cf46ba62f9"], "node": "12b3a6d1a48037e4fd3dda75847ea1a2d0ad4bb4", "parents": ["24c0960fe6bcf9225b88e7af2498de4eaa754c44"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Oriol Brufau \u003cobrufau@igalia.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076598 [wpt PR 63076] - Change crashtest to avoid a huge amount of rejected promise warnings, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nChange crashtest to avoid a huge amount of rejected promise warnings\n\nThe test was using `setInterval` with a callback that would throw on\nServo in a way that `clearInterval` would never be reached. The delay\nwas also 0, thus potentially resulting in a huge amount of warnings\nabout the unhandled promise rejections.\n\nSo this patch changes the test to avoid `setInterval`. I have ensured\nthat it would still crash Firefox before\nhttps://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D279307\n\nSigned-off-by: Oriol Brufau \u003cobrufau@igalia.com\u003e\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: e9a2d4865babcc0743bfe54754638b675a7bef81\nwpt-pr: 63076\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/selection/crashtests/selection-modify-extend-foward-line-across-video-in-html.html"], "git_node": "f8a02e97d6aa8b267ff3215373759e5658689d17", "git_parents": ["ccc510a7775018dd7e73775d9bf197bc5892c966"], "node": "37c5eac4700729372ced2e808e811c1d55c3bb21", "parents": ["12b3a6d1a48037e4fd3dda75847ea1a2d0ad4bb4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Philip Rogers \u003cpdr@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076597 [wpt PR 63075] - [html-in-canvas] Update pseudo, SVG, visited, and internal privacy tests to use drawable, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[html-in-canvas] Update pseudo, SVG, visited, and internal privacy tests to use drawable\n\nThis patch updates the html-in-canvas pseudo-element, SVG, visited-link,\nand internal privacy tests to explicitly add the `drawabl