ps://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/14251\n\nFixed: 556222889\nChange-Id: I094ea6d667f34efa310efa94de16b1488aacbea7\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8487253\nReviewed-by: Joey Arhar \u003cjarhar@chromium.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: David Baron \u003cdbaron@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Joey Arhar \u003cjarhar@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1707532}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: ca523f34696284593c3bb209cd4e0635801c3914\nwpt-pr: 63070\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-forms/appearance-base-cursor.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/semantics/forms/the-select-element/customizable-select/select-base-appearance-computed-style.html"], "git_node": "844f7e0c79a196b5c29a854eadcc0f404b030e4d", "git_parents": ["a73c0a74da4667218990fc9c3536a92d28a51a5b"], "node": "2f9ca6480b05d899b5c36d5cfde5f17562187fd0", "parents": ["06e4caa23f1f89e0f69772fd2a43f4d3536b9376"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076584 [wpt PR 63070] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 63070\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-forms/appearance-base-cursor.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/semantics/forms/the-select-element/customizable-select/all-revert-crash.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/semantics/forms/the-select-element/customizable-select/select-base-appearance-computed-style.html.ini"], "git_node": "c7930cdf7eeb783be2cbba1575c7ab6ff2f1ca91", "git_parents": ["844f7e0c79a196b5c29a854eadcc0f404b030e4d"], "node": "524a0ca71fca3887df143e6f5d08c3c31168cd85", "parents": ["2f9ca6480b05d899b5c36d5cfde5f17562187fd0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Philip Rogers \u003cpdr@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076579 [wpt PR 63067] - [html-in-canvas] Update offscreen, WebGL, WebGPU, and internal tests to use drawable, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[html-in-canvas] Update offscreen, WebGL, WebGPU, and internal tests to use drawable\n\nThis patch updates the html-in-canvas OffscreenCanvas, WebGL, WebGPU,\nand internal element-canvas-transform-disabled tests to explicitly add\nthe `drawable` attribute to canvas child elements.\n\nBug: 565840012\nChange-Id: If67e9392e0aa34468a7c9ab9e96dd7efce35e915\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8488106\nCommit-Queue: Philip Rogers \u003cpdr@chromium.org\u003e\nAuto-Submit: Philip Rogers \u003cpdr@chromium.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Stefan Zager \u003cszager@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1707536}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 97025d4b1a726b5e2f75385fe55433878bb3c97c\nwpt-pr: 63067\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/offscreen/manual/draw-element-image/animated-gif-worker.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/offscreen/manual/draw-element-image/canvas-transform-update-worker.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/offscreen/manual/draw-element-image/getElementTransform-worker.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/offscreen/manual/draw-element-image/ink-overflow-worker.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/offscreen/manual/draw-element-image/offscreenCanvas-drawElementImage-worker.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/offscreen/manual/draw-element-image/offscreenCanvas-drawElementImage.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/offscreen/manual/draw-element-image/scale-worker.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/offscreen/manual/draw-element-image/video-worker.tentative.html"], "git_node": "0a0aaadaeb04b8bbd1cd573b2e954f9853fe36b0", "git_parents": ["c7930cdf7eeb783be2cbba1575c7ab6ff2f1ca91"], "node": "b54127808468a4f3792e0d902421bc014ba5fd70", "parents": ["524a0ca71fca3887df143e6f5d08c3c31168cd85"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Shubham Gupta \u003cshubhamg13.work@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072508 [wpt PR 62734] - FCP requires both paintable and contentful., a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nFCP requires both paintable and contentful. (#62734)\n\nSigned-off-by: Shubham Gupta \u003cshubhamg13.work@gmail.com\u003e\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 0994884f6e94f51a956df599b9b0d95fe2e15443\nwpt-pr: 62734\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/paint-timing/fcp-only/fcp-requires-both-paintable-and-contentful.html"], "git_node": "3013753da5a966788eec15feb8b60a661c57eb2a", "git_parents": ["0a0aaadaeb04b8bbd1cd573b2e954f9853fe36b0"], "node": "d3078bb1e1891d7eeb33f62d4c0e9a39c8fe598b", "parents": ["b54127808468a4f3792e0d902421bc014ba5fd70"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Philip Rogers \u003cpdr@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076580 [wpt PR 63068] - [html-in-canvas] Update drawing, onpaint, and nested canvas WPTs to use drawable, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[html-in-canvas] Update drawing, onpaint, and nested canvas WPTs to use drawable\n\nThis patch updates the html-in-canvas drawing, onpaint, requestPaint,\nnested canvas, iframe, and sizing WPT tests to explicitly add the\n`drawable` attribute to canvas child elements.\n\nBug: 565840012\nChange-Id: I89b02df234419e06de54a92ffdd981fe37b7a61f\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8486718\nAuto-Submit: Philip Rogers \u003cpdr@chromium.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Stefan Zager \u003cszager@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Philip Rogers \u003cpdr@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Stefan Zager \u003cszager@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1707560}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: f9a9aee865822ce655b64be9c647f71461183f28\nwpt-pr: 63068\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/element/manual/draw-element-image/animated-gif-pinned-to-element-image.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/element/manual/draw-element-image/animated-gif.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tes