\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331275\n", "files": ["js/src/gc/WeakMap.cpp", "js/src/jit-test/tests/gc/bug-2077761.js"], "git_node": "fd570437f0982ea739b7165ae476743af93a9a7b", "git_parents": ["a9b6bb23e58fb88af23eba40e7ae812529e0f32c"], "node": "00c7157e00a7770d9a5ecef684a353610f8e296e", "parents": ["aa1eea7fb5b9c4b4d21a5163e1bef3f28b901252"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079065. r=gfx-reviewers,sotaro\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331497\n", "files": ["gfx/ipc/CanvasManagerChild.cpp"], "git_node": "b7b512a5a194e1b75570e0c62133cfd37c6a60bb", "git_parents": ["fd570437f0982ea739b7165ae476743af93a9a7b"], "node": "2105129fa9eee84f7e74fc612da7200e25d5befc", "parents": ["00c7157e00a7770d9a5ecef684a353610f8e296e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "AndiAJ \u003candiaj@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2078576 - Convert defaultSearchCodeDuckDuckGoUSTest regression UI test to the efficiency framework r=aaronmt\n\nHad to refactor the legacy test to match the manual test.\n\nBoth the \"legacy\" and \"efficiency\" UI tests successfully passed 25x on Firebase \u2705\nAll \"legacy\" and \"efficiency\" UI tests successfully passed 1x on Firebase \u2705\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331125\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/SearchTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/generation/behavior/SelectorTemplate.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/pageObjects/BookmarksPage.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/selectors/BookmarksSelectors.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/tests/BookmarksTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/ja